1
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,520
He dribbled past him!
过人啊

2
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,920
Jeez, what a lousy shot.
妈呀，这臭球

3
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,640
I'd do better out there myself.
还不如我上去踢呢

4
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,440
How many chicken racks have you had?
干几个鸡架了？

5
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:33,440
Are you watching the game or keeping watch?
这看球还是盯人呢？

6
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,800
However many I eat, it's not on your dime.
我干几个也不用你花钱

7
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:39,080
I've been watching all morning. My eyes are going blind.
这盯一上午了，眼睛都快盯瞎了

8
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,800
I don't even want to scold you two.
不爱说你俩

9
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,440
You can't take Xing San's word seriously.
那邢三儿的话能当真呀？

10
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,440
Boss!
老板

11
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,000
Another plate of chicken hearts.
再来盘鸡心

12
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,960
Coming right up.
好咧

13
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:49,160
Go easy on those. They're high in cholesterol.
那玩意儿少吃呀，胆固醇高

14
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:51,040
I ordered them for you. You are what you eat.
给你点的，吃啥补啥

15
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,040
Then save them for you and my brother-in-law.
那留给你跟我姐夫吧

16
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,480
Perfect late-night snack for you two.
正好你俩当夜宵

17
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,520
What are you doing?
干啥呢？

18
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,840
Hold onto this sketch. I've got an errand to run.
拿着这画像，我办点事去

19
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,640
How big an ass needs that much paper?
多大屁股用那么多张纸呀？

20
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,680
Am I keeping you from wiping your mouth?
我耽误你擦嘴了？

21
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,560
Didn't you say no bathroom breaks?
你不是不让上厕所吗？

22
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,320
So strict with others, so lenient with yourself.
对别人要求特多，不知道严于律己呀

23
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,880
How old am I? How old are you?
我多大岁数？ 你多大岁数？

24
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,360
Can you show some respect for the elderly?
尊重点老年人行不行？

25
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:17,280
I'm on insulin shots and still toughing it out here.
我扎胰岛素，还在这挺着呢

26
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,320
-No bathroom here, right?
-Not here.
-没厕所是吧？
-这没有

27
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,040
-That way.
-Get going. Don't crap your pants.
-往那边走
-你赶紧去吧，别拉裤兜子了

28
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,440
Make yourself useful. Keep your eyes peeled.
起点作用，盯住了啊

29
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,320
A lazy donkey always needs to piss at work.
懒驴上磨屎尿多

30
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,440
Pass it! Don't you know how to pass?
传，传球不会呀？

31
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,400
Hey, don't clear this table.
那什么，这桌别收拾啊

32
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,320
-I'll be right back.
-Sure thing.
-我马上回来
-好，行

33
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:50,000
(Sports Lottery Super Lotto)
（体彩大乐透）

34
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,800
Ah, forget it.
不管了

35
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,680
Play these numbers.
照这个打

36
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,920
You still want change?
还找钱吗？

37
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,480
Why not just grab some scratch cards?
整几张刮刮乐得了吧？

38
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,000
What's the fun in those?
整那有啥意思？

39
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,360
There's no skill involved.
也没啥技术含量

40
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,520
Those are quick.
那玩意快啊

41
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,080
One flip and you know.
一翻两瞪眼

42
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,440
Give me one, then.
妳给我来一张吧

43
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:22,600
Here. The money.
给，钱

44
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,680
Knock yourself out.
玩吧

45
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:30,160
-Did anyone win today?
-Yeah.
-今天有人中奖吗？
-有呀

46
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,840
-How many?
-Two.
-中几个呀？
-两个

47
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,560
Why didn't you say so earlier?
那妳不早说

48
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:36,280
It's struck twice already, no third time.
My luck's run out.
那再一再二不再三嘛 哪还轮得到我了？

49
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,120
It's all down to luck anyway.
那玩意得看运气吧

50
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:40,240
-You're hustling me here. Honestly...
-Well...
-妳这不坑我吗？ 妳說妳
-这…

51
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,720
-Boss, ten yuan's worth for me.
-Sure.
-老板，给我来十块钱的
-好咧

52
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:46,320
-Uh... all quick picks.
-Quick picks?
-那个…全要机选的呀
-机选啊

53
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,760
What's the fun in quick picks?
机选有啥意思？

54
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,760
Isn't that just wasting money?
那不浪费钱吗？

55
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,320
The machine's theirs.
Why would it side with you
机器是人家的，能跟你一伙啊？

56
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,600
and let you win?
让你中奖

57
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:57,480
Come on, you pick your own numbers.
How many times have you won?
不是，你手写的，你中过几回奖呀？

58
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,320
And how many times have you won with quick picks?
你机选你中几回呀？

59
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:01,360
Man, how many times have I won?
妈呀，我中了几回？

60
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,360
Let me tell you.
我告诉你

61
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,560
My car, my apartment...
我车、房

62
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,640
All bought with quick-pick winnings. Believe it?
我全靠机选中奖买的，知道不？

63
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,720
Keep bragging.
吹吧你

64
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,280
Hey, bragging's tax-free anyway.
反正也不上税

65
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,280
Buddy,
大哥

66
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,800
let me give you a piece of advice.
我奉劝你一句

67
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,080
Before you buy a lottery ticket,
买彩票之前

68
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,560
fill your heart with peace and devotion.
内心多一些平和和虔诚

69
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,080
What kind of attitude is that?
什么态度呢？

70
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,920
You don't know a kindness when you see one.
不识好歹

71
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,280
He really won't budge, soft or hard.
还真是软硬不吃

72
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,480
Print me a quick pick too.
给我也打张机选

73
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,960
To the traffic police.
去交警队

74
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,160
Then get another cab.
那你换个车吧

75
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,200
I'm not taking fares today.
今儿我不拉活

76
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,480
You don't have a choice.
你不拉不行

77
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,760
Move it.
赶紧的

78
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:00,400
Hey, what do you think you're doing?
不是，你想干点啥呀？

79
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,920
You know damn well what I'm doing.
我干啥你心里没数呀？

80
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,120
-I've got things to do.
-You don't want your cab anymore?
-我还有事呢
-车都不要了是吧？

81
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:07,120
-Trying to run?
-Bro, what are you doing? Hey...
-想跑是吧？
-哥，你干啥？ 不是

82
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,080
Not short on cash, huh?
不差钱呀？

83
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,400
Bro, easy! Wait...
哥，你轻点，不是

84
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:12,040
Your apartment and car were bought
with quick picks, right?
房子跟车都是机选买的，是不？

85
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,440
-Bro...
-Don't you struggle with me.
-哥
-别跟我拉扯

86
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,760
Don't tussle. I've had training, you know.
别拉扯，我可练过呀

87
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,960
The two of us, over a quick pick?
咱俩因为一个机选的事

88
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,240
Is this really necessary?
咱俩至于这样吗？

89
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:19,360
-Cut the crap.
-I'm telling you, my arm was hurt in a fight.
-你别跟我瞎扯
-我告诉你，我胳膊以前跟人打过仗

90
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:20,480
-Don't move...
-It's injured! Easy!
-别动…
-有伤呀，你轻点

91
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,160
You... what are you... hey, is this necessary?
你…你干…不是，咱至于吗？

92
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,520
Calling in backup, over this little thing?
还找帮手，这点事呀

93
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,720
You flatter yourself.
Why would I need backup to handle you?
我给你脸了，我整你我还找帮手

94
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,120
Ever heard of mixed martial arts?
知道综合格斗不？

95
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,640
Are we even in the same weight class?
是一级别的吗咱俩？

96
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,400
I could crush you just by sitting on you.
我压我都压死你了我

97
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,000
Done squirming yet?
拉完没呀？

98
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,760
-Go ahead.
-Found him. Get over here.
-你说
-找着了，赶紧过来

99
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,600
Bro, you can stop digging.
大哥，你就别掏了吧

100
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,960
There's nothing in my pockets.
我兜里啥也没有

101
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,760
I haven't had a single fare today.
今天我还没拉着活呢

102
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:46,840
He thinks we're highway robbers.
把我们当劫道的了

103
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:51,360
So... so you're not robbing me?
那…那你们不是劫财的？

104
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:53,120
Let me give you a piece of advice.
我奉劝你一句呀

105
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:55,320
In a bit, answer whatever we ask. Got it?
一会问你啥你答啥，知道不？

106
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:59,040
Just keep that peace and devotion
in your heart, and you'll be fine.
你内心就带着平和和那个虔诚就行了

107
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:02,440
Fellas, did you maybe grab the wrong guy?
几个大哥，咱是不是找错人了？

108
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:04,560
I've got no beef with you. What is this?
咱无怨无仇的，这是干啥呀？

109
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:06,880
No mistake.
没找错

110
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,560
You're exactly who we want.
找的就是你

111
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,480
Do I even know you?
我认识你吗？

112
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,680
The cornfield.
玉米地

113
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,840
You ran pretty fast.
跑得挺快呀

114
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,080
Got scared after you hit someone?
撞完人害怕了？

115
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,920
Hey, what do you mean?
不是，你啥意思？

116
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,400
When did I ever hit anyone?
我什么时候撞人了我呀？

117
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,840
Let me jog your memory.
我给你提个醒吧

118
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:24,160
The morning of October 20th,
you were driving this cab,
10月20号上午，你就开着这车

119
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,280
with fake plates: Hua AW357F.
套的桦AW357F的牌

120
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,320
Ring a bell?
想起来没？

121
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,640
Bro, come on, I'm just an unlicensed cabbie.
不是，大哥，我就是个开黑车的

122
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,240
I'm no gangster.
我不是混黑社会的

123
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:35,200
Who would I dare hit? Me, run someone over?
我敢撞谁呀？ 我撞人呢

124
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:37,480
Young man, the three of us aren't cops.
小伙子，我们仨不是警察

125
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,440
Hey, even if you said you were cops,
不是，你们说你们是警察

126
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,520
I'd have to believe it first.
我也得能信呢

127
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,840
-Why so chatty?
-What are you doing?
-你话怎么那么多呢？
-你干啥？

128
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:44,720
-No rough stuff. Ask nicely.
-Just answer what we ask, all right?
-你别动手，好好问
-问你啥你答啥得了嘛

129
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,840
What's going on?
怎么回事呀？

130
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,400
Here's the thing.
就是一句话

131
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,880
We're not after you.
我们找的不是你

132
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,680
We're after the person you hit.
找的是你撞的那个人

133
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:52,120
I'll say it one more time.
我再说一遍

134
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,200
I didn't hit anyone.
我谁也没撞

135
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,840
Kid, why are you so stubborn?
不是，你这个小子 你怎么这么倔呢？

136
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:58,360
If we had no evidence,
why would the three of us come for you?
要没证据，我们仨干嘛找你？

137
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,640
You hit someone. That's settled fact.
你撞人了，这个事落实妥妥的了

138
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:04,080
Just tell us who you hit,
只要你说出来你撞的是谁

139
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,640
and we'll let you go right away.
我们马上就放你走

140
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,720
Playing peaceful now, huh?
玩平和呢在这

141
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,360
Easy with him.
你轻点你呀

142
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,760
-Biaozi, do it.
-All right then.
-彪子，动手吧
-那行

143
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,280
Don't pull the knife.
你别掏刀

144
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,840
What knife? We can't go committing crimes.
掏什么刀？ 不能再犯罪了

145
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,240
-I'll cripple him.
-Bro, look at yourselves...
-我把他废了
-大哥，你看你们几个

146
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:19,240
at your age.
都这么大岁数了

147
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,600
Why would we go that far?
咱扯那干啥呀咱是？

148
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,320
Won't talk, huh?
不说是吧？

149
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,960
What do we do?
怎么办？

150
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,920
Turn him in.
报官吧

151
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,760
You're done for. This time you're really done for.
你废了，这回你废了

152
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,200
(PAUSED)
（暂停）

153
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,840
All right, thank you for supporting our work.
行，感谢你们支持我的工作

154
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,120
Oh, comrade, no need for thanks.
不是，同志，感谢就不用了

155
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,240
Police and people are one family, after all.
警民一家亲嘛

156
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,960
Then let's not stand on ceremony.
那一家人不说两家话

157
00:08:42,040 --> 00:08:43,560
When can I drive my cab out of here?
我那车啥时候能开走呀？

158
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,680
-Go to the accident division for the paperwork.
-Sure.
-行，你去事故科办手续吧
-好咧

159
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:48,400
Comrade, he didn't just fake the plates.
There's definitely more to it.
同志，他不光套牌，肯定有别的事

160
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,800
Please find out who he hit.
你帮我问问他撞的人是谁

161
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,000
Don't you worry.
这个你放心

162
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,840
Hit-and-run means criminal charges, guaranteed.
肇事逃逸肯定追究刑事责任

163
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,600
Everything will be investigated thoroughly.
啥事都得问明白呀

164
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,800
-We'll notify you once we have results.
-Good.
-一有结果通知你
-好

165
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,000
-Head on back now.
-All right.
-赶紧回去吧
-好

166
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,400
-Let me know when you have results.
-Sure.
-有结果告诉我呀
-好

167
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,680
The name's Wang Xiang.
我叫王响

168
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,600
-"Xiang," as in "resounding."
-Sure...
-“响亮”的“响”
-行…

169
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,840
Wang Xiang.
王响

170
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:08,440
What are you really after?
你到底要查啥？

171
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,320
Another plate of lamb.
再来一盘羊肉

172
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,240
What seafood do you have?
妳家有啥海鲜呢？

173
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,480
-We have squid.
-Add a squid.
-有鱿鱼
-再来个鱿鱼

174
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,440
Don't order so much. We can't finish it all.
别点那么多，吃不了

175
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,560
It's not much. Add a bellflower root salad.
不多，再拌个桔梗

176
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:27,680
Go ahead. We'll order more if needed.
去吧，一会不够再点

177
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:28,720
Sure thing.
好咧

178
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,240
Since you two won't get things started,
I'll propose the first toast.
你俩也不张罗，那我先提一个吧

179
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,640
How can we start without drinks?
没酒怎么张罗呀？

180
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,880
How could there be no drinks?
哪能没酒呢？

181
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,160
Here, brother-in-law.
来，姐夫

182
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:46,560
This meal is mainly to treat Captain Ma.
这顿饭主要是请马队

183
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,480
That's right.
对

184
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,280
If it weren't for you,
要没有你呢

185
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,920
I wouldn't have gotten my cab back so fast.
我车也不能那么快开回来

186
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,320
No need to thank me.
不用谢我

187
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:54,600
Once the matter was cleared up,
naturally the cab was returned.
这事整明白了，自然车就还你了

188
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,120
No, you can't put it that way.
不，那话不能这么说

189
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,720
Without you,
要没你

190
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,160
it wouldn't have gone so smoothly.
这事也不能办那么痛快呀

191
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,360
-Right.
-Am I right?
-是
-是不？

192
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,760
-Come on then.
-Cheers.
-那来吧
-来

193
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,680
Here, eat up.
来，吃菜

194
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,720
Aren't you going to propose one?
你不提一个呀？

195
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,840
Nothing you want to say?
不想说点啥呀？

196
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:22,880
Go on, say something.
提一个吧

197
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:25,640
To Captain Ma.
谢马队

198
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,920
I don't want to hear that.
不听这个

199
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,240
Say something else.
说点别的

200
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:32,680
Like what?
啥呀？

201
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:35,240
Honestly, what should I say?
说实话吧，说啥呀？

202
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,520
Brother-in-law, Captain Ma is one of us.
姐夫，马队也不是外人

203
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,040
Just say whatever's on your mind.
有啥话直说吧

204
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,520
What I'd say isn't exactly solid.
我说那玩意也没啥准

205
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,800
Better not say it.
还是不说了

206
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:47,280
If you won't drink, let's eat.
你要不喝，咱吃

207
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,640
Then can I say it?
那我能说吧？

208
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:52,120
Well, who did that fake-plate car hit?
不是，那套牌车撞的人是谁呀？

209
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:55,040
You two went through all this trouble.
你俩费这么大劲

210
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:57,360
What do you want with him?
找他干啥呀？

211
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:05,640
Stop keeping it under wraps.
别掖着藏着了

212
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,920
It's pointless.
没意思

213
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:16,600
Since the conversation's come this far,
那嗑都唠到这了

214
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:18,720
let me tell you something interesting.
那我就说点有意思的

215
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,360
The person that fake-plate car hit...
套牌车撞的那个人

216
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,720
is the one who got Yang'er killed.
就是害阳儿的那个人

217
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,760
That's a bit interesting, no?
这话有点意思吧？

218
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,680
Interesting.
有意思

219
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,840
Go on then.
那你接着说吧

220
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,640
We got him on camera.
拍着了

221
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:58,560
There's no face here.
这脸都没有

222
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,680
How can you tell it's him?
你是怎么看出来的？

223
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,000
Look.
你看

224
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:06,640
You didn't believe me back then.
当初我说你就不相信

225
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,960
And you still don't believe me now.
现在你还是不相信

226
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:10,480
So what's the point of me talking?
我说这有啥意思呢？

227
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:12,360
What do you expect me to believe?
你让我信啥？

228
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,040
Wang Xiang,
王响

229
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,920
this business with Yang'er
has made you obsessed.
阳儿这事把你给整魔怔了

230
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:19,960
He's lost it, and you're losing it with him?
他魔怔了，你也陪着魔怔啊？

231
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,000
No, Captain Ma.
不是，马队

232
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,200
-It's mainly my brother-in-law...
-No, if you got to the bottom of this,
-主要我姐夫…
-不是，你要把这个事整明白了

233
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,840
would I still be obsessed?
我能不能魔怔？

234
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,360
Wang Yang committed suicide.
王阳是自杀

235
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:27,960
I told you that 18 years ago.
18年前我就跟你说了

236
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:29,360
It wasn't suicide.
他不是自杀

237
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,240
I know my own son.
我儿子我了解

238
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,640
His killer was Fu Weijun.
杀他的人就是傅卫军

239
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,800
Here we go again.
又来了

240
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:35,880
Haven't I told you?
我跟你说过没有？

241
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,280
When you were at the railway tracks,
你在火车道的时候

242
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,320
Fu Weijun had already been caught by us.
那傅卫军让我们警察都抓住了嘛

243
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,600
Then how did he get to the tracks?
那他怎么去的火车道？

244
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:42,360
Exactly. It wasn't him.
所以不是他呀

245
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:48,480
You don't have to believe me,
你可以不相信我

246
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:50,440
but when we arrested him,
可抓他的时候

247
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:52,000
so many pairs of eyes were watching.
那么多双眼睛就在那看着呢

248
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,000
Could they all be wrong?
能看错了？

249
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,360
Which is why you're wrong.
所以说你错了

250
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,560
You were wrong 18 years ago.
当初18年前你就错了

251
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:57,600
Everyone, calm down.
都消消气

252
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:58,640
Don't you say a word.
你别说话

253
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,640
Just tell me this:
你就告诉我

254
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,000
Fu Weijun is in prison now.
傅卫军现在在监狱里呢

255
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,720
How could he have gotten out
and been hit by a car?
他怎么就出来让车给撞的？

256
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,880
Then tell me, how did my son die?
你告诉我，我儿子怎么死的？

257
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,440
Why are you shouting at the two of us?
你跟我俩这吵吵啥呢？

258
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:08,160
Do you think we cops just talk nonsense all day?
我们警察在这天天胡说八道呢？

259
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:11,040
We rely on evidence, not imagination.
我们讲究的是证据，不是在这想像

260
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,720
Is this imagination? Isn't this evidence?
这是想像吗？ 这不是证据吗？

261
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:14,520
-How is this not evidence?
-This what?
-这还不是证据吗？
-这啥？

262
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:17,200
No face in it. If this isn't imagination,
then what is it?
脸都没有，这不是想像，这是啥？

263
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:18,440
What is this?
这是啥？

264
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:20,200
-Just tell me...
-Nothing, it's fine...
-你就告诉我
-没事呀…

265
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:21,400
It's nothing. Sorry about that.
没事，不好意思呀

266
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,320
It's fine...
没事…

267
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,840
Sorry, folks...
不好意思呀…

268
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,120
A little too much to drink.
借点酒劲

269
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,200
Both of you, calm down.
都消消气

270
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:31,040
How old are you two combined?
加一起多大岁数了？

271
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,240
What are you doing?
干啥呀？

272
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,640
Take it home, whatever it is.
有事回去说吧

273
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,080
Wang Xiang, you need to understand
王响，你得明白

274
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,640
what I'm saying.
我说的啥意思

275
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:42,160
You dwell on this day after day.
你天天想这事，天天想这事

276
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,880
Anyone would lose their mind.
搁谁他都得魔怔了

277
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,240
Whose family hasn't lost someone?
谁家不死个人？

278
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,720
My wife died of cancer last year.
我老伴去年癌症走的

279
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,080
So what? Should I stop living?
怎么的？ 我还不活了？

280
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:54,160
Is that the same thing, Captain Ma?
那能一样吗，马队？

281
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,560
Your wife died of illness.
你老伴是病死的

282
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,880
She died in a hospital, in a bed.
死在医院，死在床上

283
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,680
That's a peaceful, natural death.
那叫寿终正寝

284
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:04,440
My son wasn't even 20,
and he died in the water.
我儿子20岁不到，死在水里

285
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:06,720
How can I not think about it every day?
我能不天天想吗我？

286
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,000
Calm down.
消消气

287
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:49,000
Is the rest still coming?
还上不？

288
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,680
Coming? Who cares?
上啥上呀？

289
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:51,680
Can we return it?
能退不？

290
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:54,080
-Sir, we can't take dishes back.
-Then pack it up...
-大哥，这菜我们退不了
-打包…

291
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,120
What's with that attitude of yours?
啥态度呀妳呀？

292
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,040
I came here demanding some accountability,
you hear me?
我到这来就是要妳一个态度 妳知道不？

293
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,000
My attitude has been perfectly fine.
我一直态度挺好

294
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:51,960
-Pay up.
-What kind of attitude is this?
-赔钱
-妳们什么态度？

295
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,880
-The pay-compensation kind. Pay up.
-But...
-赔钱的态度，赔钱
-不是…

296
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:54,960
You...
妳…

297
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:56,480
Well, isn't that Xu-jie?
这不徐姐吗？

298
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,200
What's that on your... did you get a stye?
怎么起…起针眼了？

299
00:15:58,280 --> 00:16:00,360
Bullshit. What stye?
别放屁，长啥针眼呢？

300
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:02,080
I had two perfect double eyelids.
我本来俩大双眼皮

301
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,800
Look what your wife did to me.
你看看你媳妇给我整的

302
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:05,000
Now one's single and one's double.
一单一双了都

303
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:07,120
Once I finish your other eye, we're done, right?
我把那只也给妳整完就完事了吧？

304
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,920
Right. You fix my eye properly
对，妳把姐给那眼睛整好了

305
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,280
and don't charge me for it.
妳别收人钱了

306
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:11,760
Call it a freebie.
当赠送了

307
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,400
You think I'd still let you touch me?
还敢让妳整呀？

308
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,680
If you blind me, whose fault is that?
整瞎了算谁的？

309
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:17,160
It's cold out here. Come in and talk.
门口挺冷的，进来说吧

310
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:19,320
What's wrong? Back-alley clinic scared of being heard?
怎么的？ 黑诊所怕人听见呀？

311
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:21,000
Scared of what? Everything I do is legit.
我怕啥呀？ 我这都正规的

312
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,840
Legit, my ass. You got a license?
你这正规啥呀？ 有资格证吗？

313
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:23,840
I'm in the process of getting one.
我正办着呢

314
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:24,880
So that's a no.
那就是没有吧

315
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:27,360
I'll have it any day now. It's coming through.
马上不就有了吗？ 这两天就下来了

316
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:30,280
This is practicing medicine without a license, you know that?
你这叫非法行医，知不知道？

317
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:32,720
Xu-jie, let's be fair here.
徐姐，咱平心而论呀

318
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:35,040
A procedure like yours would run six grand at a real hospital, no?
就妳这个项目 在正规医院得不得六千块钱？

319
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:37,840
At my place, I gave you two grand with ten percent off.
妳在我这，我给妳两千块钱打九折

320
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:39,320
You get what you pay for.
什么价格，什么服务

321
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:40,600
Don't you know that much?
妳心里没点数吗？

322
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,640
So I was cheap, and I deserve this? Is that it?
妳那意思我贪便宜，活该了吧？

323
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,080
I never said that. Listen here—
我可没这么说呀，我告诉妳

324
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:45,360
-Enough...
-Hey! Get your hands off!
-别说了…
-干什么？ 还上手

325
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:47,240
Stop wasting breath on her. Let's call the cops.
别跟她废话了，咱报警吧

326
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,120
No... call... call what? Don't call.
别…报…报啥报？ 别报

327
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:51,480
We've got a problem, let's work it out.
咱有问题解决问题吧

328
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,880
I'll pay whatever's fair, fair and square.
就该怎么赔就怎么赔

329
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:56,600
You think this is about the money?
那是钱多少的事吗？

330
00:16:57,920 --> 00:16:59,520
If you two are willing to pay up,
你俩要认赔

331
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,040
-150 grand.
-How much?!
-15个吧
-多少钱？

332
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:04,160
150 grand? You're shaking us down!
15个？ 妳讹人呢妳？

333
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,520
Who are you calling a scammer?
妳說谁讹人呢妳？

334
00:17:05,600 --> 00:17:06,840
I'm calling YOU scammers. So what?
我就說妳们讹人怎么的？

335
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,320
Is 150 grand too much?
15个多呀？

336
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,000
If I go blind,
我要瞎了

337
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:11,600
you're doing time, got it?
妳得进去知道不？

338
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,680
Enough.
别说了

339
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,960
Come on, sis.
不是，姐

340
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:15,960
We're all old Hualin Steel folks, right?
都桦钢老人了，是不？

341
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:17,880
We can talk anything over nicely.
那好商好量吧啥事

342
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:20,520
Do me a solid here, knock it down some.
妳给我个面子，打个折

343
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:21,760
How's ten grand sound?
一万块钱行不？

344
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,360
Here, take the phone. Call the cops.
来，电话，报警

345
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,000
Who do you think you are?
你多大脸呢？

346
00:17:25,080 --> 00:17:27,000
Is that mug of yours worth 140 grand?
你那脸值14万？

347
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,560
Go ahead, call them. Go on...
那妳报吧，报…

348
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:31,400
Call, get her locked up for ten years.
妳报完给她抓进去，让她判十年

349
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:32,720
Go ahead.
妳报吧

350
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:37,280
See if a single cent lands in your pocket then.
妳看到时候一分钱能进妳们兜不

351
00:17:37,359 --> 00:17:38,480
Think it over.
妳合计合计

352
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:45,319
Everything's open to discussion, right?
啥事好说好商量嘛

353
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:47,240
I charged you 1,800 in total,
一共收妳一千八

354
00:17:47,319 --> 00:17:48,960
and bam, you demand 150 grand.
妳咣要15万

355
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:51,079
I'd love to give you 200 million—if I had it.
我还想给妳两亿呢，咱得有呀

356
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,240
Is any of this realistic?
切合实际吗？

357
00:17:52,319 --> 00:17:53,160
How about this:
妳这么的

358
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:55,280
You refund her the 1,800,
妳把姐那一千八给人退回去

359
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,319
and we pay another 30 grand on top. Deal?
咱再赔三万块钱行不？

360
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,280
What am I, a dog you're shooing off?
你打发狗呢？

361
00:17:58,359 --> 00:17:59,640
You think I'm some beggar?
你打发要饭的呢？

362
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,200
Give me the phone. I'm calling the cops.
给我电话，必须报警

363
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:04,600
Then how much do you want?
那妳要多少钱呀？

364
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:08,800
100 grand.
十万

365
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:11,680
-I can't come up with 100 grand.
-Haggle any more and this talk's over.
-十万块钱我拿不出来
-你俩要再讲价，咱可不谈了呀

366
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,400
100 grand, flat.
就十万

367
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:15,160
Signed and sealed.
签字画押的

368
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:17,240
Set in stone. No backing out.
死牌落地，不带反悔的

369
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,320
Careful...
慢点…

370
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:27,640
Take care now.
慢走呀

371
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,560
Sorry about all this, Xu-jie.
不好意思呀，徐姐

372
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,640
Take care, Xu-jie.
慢走呀，徐姐

373
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:34,600
Who are you "Xu-jie"-ing?
跟谁俩徐姐徐姐的呢？

374
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,920
She looks older than me.
瞅着比我都老

375
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,120
No money by end of week, we meet at the police station.
这周再见不着钱，派出所见

376
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,680
Got it, Xu-jie.
知道了，徐姐

377
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,680
Watch your step. Hold on to me.
妳看着点道，扶着点

378
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:01,920
Liu-ge.
六哥

379
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,240
I'm looking to sell my taxi plate.
我那车标想转出去

380
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:04,680
Can you ask around for me?
你帮我问问啊

381
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:05,960
What's it going for now?
现在啥价呀？

382
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,120
It dropped again?
又降了？

383
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,880
100 grand works too.
十个也行

384
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,120
I need cash.
我要现钱

385
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:13,720
I'll wait to hear from you.
那我等你信

386
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:26,280
Shit, gave them too much corn.
操，玉米喂多了

387
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:45,800
What's wrong?
怎么的了？

388
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:47,800
Why are you crying?
妳哭啥呀？

389
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:49,880
I'm not blaming you.
我又没埋怨妳

390
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:52,840
Besides, isn't it all sorted now?
再说问题不都解决了吗？

391
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:53,840
Stop crying, okay?
别哭了啊

392
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:57,240
Where am I supposed to scrape up 100 grand?
我上哪去给人整十万块钱去？

393
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:59,040
Not your problem. I've got a plan.
不用妳管，我有招

394
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:00,480
It's no big deal.
多大点事呀？

395
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:02,840
You just had to stir things up.
你就折腾吧你

396
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:05,080
Buying a car behind my back...
你背着我偷着买车

397
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:08,240
If it weren't for you, I'd have my own shop by now.
我要不是因为你 我早就把店开起来了

398
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:10,640
Would any of this have happened?
还能出这种事吗？

399
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,280
Okay, that's enough crying.
行了，别哭了

400
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:19,360
Don't touch me.
别碰我

401
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,360
Money's gone, we'll earn more.
钱没了再挣吧

402
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:25,680
Once my racing pigeons hatch,
妳等我那赛鸽一孵化

403
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:27,800
I flip them, and we're sitting on well over a hundred grand.
我一倒腾，大十几万就有了

404
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:30,640
Problems money can solve aren't real problems.
那钱能解决的问题都不是问题

405
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:31,880
Is that even a problem?
那是问题吗？

406
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:40,000
How did we let our lives end up like this?
你说咱俩怎么就把日子过成这样

407
00:20:42,800 --> 00:20:43,920
Don't you worry.
妳别着急

408
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:46,760
Once my pigeons are nesting,
妳等我那鸽子一抱窝

409
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,480
we'll be right back on our feet.
日子不又过起来了？

410
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:50,640
We're in the capital accumulation phase.
现在原始积累阶段

411
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,560
Next step, we leap up a class.
下一步就跨越阶层了

412
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:55,080
Financial freedom.
就财务自由了

413
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,600
You know what financial freedom is?
妳知道啥是财务自由？

414
00:20:56,680 --> 00:20:59,200
Making money without lifting a finger. That's freedom.
妳不干活挣钱，那叫财务自由

415
00:20:59,280 --> 00:21:01,080
Money making money, you know?
钱生钱，妳知道不？

416
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:07,400
I really envy you.
我真羡慕你

417
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:11,000
You get to live in a dream forever.
能一直活在梦里

418
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:12,600
What's so bad about that?
有啥不好的？

419
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:15,160
Dreams are just a reflection of reality.
那梦也是对现实一种映射

420
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,880
That's Freud, you know.
那佛洛伊德嘛

421
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:18,560
Biaozi.
彪子

422
00:21:19,520 --> 00:21:20,880
Let's get divorced.
咱俩离了吧

423
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:46,640
Xiaobei's room is sitting empty, right?
我看小北那屋空着嘛

424
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:49,240
Xiaobei's room isn't ours to give out.
小北那屋咱说了不算

425
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:51,800
It's fine. Try it.
挺好，你试试

426
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:57,800
I can't even stretch my legs.
这也伸不开腿呀

427
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:59,520
It's two meters long.
两公尺长呢

428
00:22:00,080 --> 00:22:01,880
How about I take your room? We can squeeze in.
要不我去你那屋吧？ 咱俩挤挤吧

429
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,680
Forget it. I'm a light sleeper.
你行了，我觉轻

430
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:06,480
Your grinding, farting, lip-smacking full-service package—
你那咬牙、放屁、吧唧嘴一条龙服务

431
00:22:06,560 --> 00:22:07,480
I can't take it.
我受不了

432
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:09,480
I'm still a guest here, aren't I?
好歹我也是个客吧？

433
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:10,880
And we're family, on top of that.
跟你还是亲戚

434
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:13,560
I'm already wounded enough from Liru.
我在丽茹那都受多大伤了

435
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:15,240
Can't you treat me a little better?
你就不能对我好点吗？

436
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:17,120
If you and Liru get divorced,
你要跟丽茹离了婚

437
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,600
you and I are coworkers at best.
咱俩顶多是个同事

438
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:20,080
Where are you going?
你干啥？

439
00:22:20,560 --> 00:22:21,400
Kitchen.
厨房

440
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,800
Can I smoke in the bathroom, then?
我去厕所抽行不？

441
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:27,920
Fine.
很好

442
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:30,640
Can I at least get a pillow?
能拿个枕头不？

443
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,840
Wash your feet before bed.
临睡之前洗个脚呀

444
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:34,040
That smell!
都啥味呀？

445
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,280
What are you doing here?
你怎么来了？

446
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,160
What, not welcome?
怎么？ 不欢迎呀？

447
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:52,200
I'll get you a towel.
我给你拿毛巾

448
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:58,000
-Biaozi.
-What?! I'm taking a shit!
-彪子
-干啥呀？ 拉屎呢

449
00:22:58,880 --> 00:22:59,880
Never mind the towel.
不用拿了

450
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:02,480
I got word on Fu Weijun.
我打听到傅卫军的消息了

451
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:12,280
He died in prison last month.
上个月他已经死在监狱里了

452
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:16,200
Dead?
死了？

453
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:24,080
(Public Telephone)
（公用电话）

454
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:28,120
(Public Telephone)
（公用电话）

455
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:41,040
Page 9532657 for me.
帮我呼9532657

456
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:46,240
Leave a message: "Jun-ge and I have arrived in Songhe."
留言就说“我和军哥到松河了”

457
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:09,680
Boss.
老板

458
00:24:13,080 --> 00:24:14,040
Boss.
老板

459
00:24:15,080 --> 00:24:16,280
Lend me a couple tokens.
借两个币

460
00:24:17,520 --> 00:24:19,200
Who borrows these things?
这玩意还有借的？

461
00:24:19,280 --> 00:24:21,600
Got money, you play. No money, go home.
有钱就玩，没钱就回家去

462
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:24,760
When my folks get back, I'll pay you back, okay?
我等我爸妈回来了 把钱还你不得了吗？

463
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:26,680
-Just this once.
-No can do.
-我就借一次
-借不了

464
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:27,840
Now scram.
赶紧起开

465
00:24:31,120 --> 00:24:32,320
50 yuan in tokens.
50的币

466
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:41,520
What's up?
怎么的了？

467
00:24:41,600 --> 00:24:42,480
Out of tokens?
没币了？

468
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:49,000
Here, take two.
给你俩

469
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:50,720
Thanks, bro.
谢谢哥

470
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,640
What were you playing just now?
你刚才玩啥游戏了？

471
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,560
The King of Fighters.
《格斗天王》

472
00:24:59,800 --> 00:25:00,880
Any good at it?
你玩得好不？

473
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,600
I'm okay.
还行

474
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:07,280
I don't like playing against the machine.
我不爱跟机子打

475
00:25:07,360 --> 00:25:09,400
How about a couple rounds with me?
你要不陪我打两局吧？

476
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,400
I, uh...
我就…

477
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:14,160
Win, and it costs you nothing.
赢了不用你花钱

478
00:25:14,240 --> 00:25:16,160
Lose, and you use my tokens.
输了用我币子

479
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:17,400
Deal.
行

480
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:18,720
I'll drop the coin for you.
我帮你投币

481
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:26,560
What's your name?
你叫啥名呀？

482
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:27,640
Shen Hui.
沉辉

483
00:25:44,640 --> 00:25:45,640
Bro.
哥

484
00:25:47,560 --> 00:25:48,640
You're back?
回来了？

485
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:51,200
Let's play a couple more rounds.
再玩两局去

486
00:25:51,280 --> 00:25:53,520
I'm done. My mom's waiting at home.
我不玩了，我妈还在家等我呢

487
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:57,520
Who are you trying to fool?
你糊弄谁呢？

488
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:00,640
Don't you live at your grandma's?
你不住你姥姥家吗？

489
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:07,080
Aren't your folks away on a trip?
你爸妈不都出远门了吗？

490
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,480
They're back?
回来了？

491
00:26:13,880 --> 00:26:15,440
What, did they fly home?
坐的飞机呀？

492
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,920
I... I really can't play anymore.
我…我真不玩了

493
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:21,200
My grandma's gonna start worrying.
我姥姥在家该等着急了

494
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:44,000
How can you just turn your back on me?
你怎么翻脸不认人呢？

495
00:26:46,360 --> 00:26:51,600
Is that all our friendship's worth?
咱俩交情就这么浅吧

496
00:26:54,120 --> 00:26:55,200
Fine.
行

497
00:26:57,000 --> 00:27:01,040
Pay me back for all those tokens.
你把以前币子的钱给我

498
00:27:01,120 --> 00:27:03,240
I... I don't have any money.
我…我没钱

499
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:05,040
I...
我…

500
00:27:05,840 --> 00:27:07,600
I... I'm broke.
我…我没钱

501
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:11,040
No money? Then what do we do?
没钱怎么办呀？

502
00:27:15,360 --> 00:27:17,960
N... nothing in here either.
这…这里也没钱

503
00:27:19,440 --> 00:27:22,160
-I... I really have nothing.
-We'll tell your teacher!
-真…真没钱
-告诉你们老师呀

504
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:29,720
Bro.
哥

505
00:27:45,360 --> 00:27:47,640
My brother asked you something.
我哥问你呢

506
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:51,320
It's fine if you've got no money.
你要是没钱也行

507
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:54,880
What'll you trade for it?
愿意拿啥换呢？

508
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:02,080
What'll you trade?
拿啥换呢？

509
00:28:03,800 --> 00:28:05,360
Bro, what do you want?
哥，你要换啥？

510
00:28:08,640 --> 00:28:11,120
Bro, what do you want?
哥，你要换啥？

511
00:28:22,800 --> 00:28:24,600
Your hand.
手

512
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:28,640
A foot works too.
脚也行

513
00:28:35,600 --> 00:28:37,440
Let me go... please, bro, I'm begging you...
放我走…哥…我求你了

514
00:28:37,520 --> 00:28:39,480
Let me go, don't...
你放我走，你别…

515
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:40,400
Bro...
哥…

516
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:42,200
Bro, let me go, please, don't...
哥，你让我走吧，哥，别…

517
00:28:42,280 --> 00:28:44,160
No... let me go, bro.
别，你让我走吧，哥

518
00:28:44,240 --> 00:28:45,320
Don't...
别…

519
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:47,760
"Typically attached at both ends to two
“通常两端附着在两块

520
00:28:47,840 --> 00:28:50,480
or more bones.
或两块以上的骨骼上面

521
00:28:50,560 --> 00:28:53,800
One: master the anatomical arrangement of skeletal muscles
一、掌握骨骼肌的解剖结构排布规律

522
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:56,040
and their accessory structures.
及其肌的辅助装置

523
00:28:56,120 --> 00:28:57,720
Two: master the trapezius
二、掌握斜方肌

524
00:28:57,800 --> 00:28:59,720
and the location and function of the latissimus dorsi.
背阔肌的位置和功能

525
00:28:59,800 --> 00:29:01,640
Three: master the pectoralis major
三、掌握胸大肌

526
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:04,000
and the location and function of the serratus anterior,
和前锯肌的位置和功能

527
00:29:04,080 --> 00:29:05,800
the location, form, and function of the diaphragm,
膈的位置形态和功能

528
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:09,240
and the names and locations of its three openings."
以及膈的三个裂孔的名称位置”

529
00:29:17,120 --> 00:29:18,440
What's wrong, auntie?
怎么的了，大娘？

530
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:21,360
What happened?
出啥事了？

531
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:23,560
It's all my fault.
都怪我

532
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:25,880
Going so far away to see a doctor...
跑这么远看病…

533
00:29:25,960 --> 00:29:27,920
Otherwise little Hui wouldn't have gotten hurt this bad.
要不小辉也出不了那么大的事

534
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,320
Stop that wailing.
别嚎丧了

535
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:34,600
I'll go check out.
我退房去

536
00:30:10,120 --> 00:30:11,520
Don't let it eat you up too much.
你也别太上火了

537
00:30:12,040 --> 00:30:13,320
A broken arm is just an external injury.
胳膊断了就是外伤

538
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,440
It heals up fine.
好养

539
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:20,120
What did you say?
妳說啥？

540
00:30:21,880 --> 00:30:24,920
But next time, it might not just be an arm.
不过再有下一次，就不一定伤哪了

541
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:26,640
Go home with auntie and heal up.
好好和大娘回去养病

542
00:30:26,720 --> 00:30:28,160
And don't come back.
别再回来了

543
00:30:36,840 --> 00:30:40,000
You will die by my hand, sooner or later.
妳早晚死我手里

544
00:30:40,560 --> 00:30:42,040
I mean it.
我说到做到

545
00:30:57,600 --> 00:30:58,800
Sooner or later,
早晚

546
00:31:00,880 --> 00:31:02,360
you'll die by my hand.
死我手里

547
00:32:13,440 --> 00:32:15,560
Yang'er, dinner's ready.
阳儿呀，吃饭了

548
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:16,920
I'm not eating, Ma.
我不吃了，妈

549
00:32:24,280 --> 00:32:25,240
What's wrong, Ma?
妳怎么了，妈？

550
00:32:25,320 --> 00:32:26,280
You okay?
没事吧？

551
00:32:27,280 --> 00:32:28,720
I feel a bit sick.
有点难受

552
00:32:31,160 --> 00:32:32,120
What's wrong?
怎么的了？

553
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,200
It's just a passing spell.
就这么一阵

554
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,480
Sit down and eat something, it'll pass.
坐下吃点东西就好了

555
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:40,440
It's just the cooking fumes.
就是油烟熏的

556
00:32:41,160 --> 00:32:42,560
Eat something and you'll be fine.
吃点东西就好了

557
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:45,000
Come on, you... sit and keep me company, eat a little.
来，你…你也坐下陪妈吃点

558
00:32:45,080 --> 00:32:46,080
Come on.
快点

559
00:32:48,040 --> 00:32:49,640
All your favorites.
都是你爱吃的

560
00:33:00,080 --> 00:33:01,760
Still mad at your dad?
还跟你爸生气呢？

561
00:33:09,280 --> 00:33:11,360
Your dad means well too.
你爸也是为你好

562
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:14,800
He's just scared Xing San won't let it go and it'll ruin your factory placement.
他不是怕邢三儿不依不饶地 影响你进厂的事吗？

563
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:16,720
After hitting you, no one hurt more than him.
打完你，他比谁都心疼

564
00:33:16,800 --> 00:33:17,680
He regrets it to death.
都后悔死了

565
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:19,480
He didn't sleep a wink last night.
昨天一晚上都没睡

566
00:33:19,560 --> 00:33:21,720
Woke up with two big blisters on his lip.
早上起来嘴上起俩大泡

567
00:33:23,560 --> 00:33:25,080
How could I not be mad?
我能不生气吗？

568
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:28,160
On the street, in front of all those people, he just hit me.
那大街上那么多人，伸手就打

569
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:30,640
Besides, is getting into the factory really that important?
再说进不进厂有那么重要吗？

570
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:31,800
Right.
是

571
00:33:32,640 --> 00:33:34,400
Only factory work counts as a real job?
就厂里工作是正经工作

572
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:36,160
And what I do isn't a real job?
我那就不是正经工作吧？

573
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:40,160
It's all labor. How does he get to rank it high and low?
都是劳动 怎么到他这还分个高低贵贱了？

574
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:44,080
Look,
这事吧

575
00:33:44,840 --> 00:33:46,640
you really should try to understand your dad.
你也真得理解你爸

576
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:48,080
Our generation,
我们这代人

577
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:50,080
we got used to having our lives arranged for us.
那是被安排惯了

578
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:53,040
As kids, with so many children at home,
你看小时候在家里孩子多

579
00:33:53,120 --> 00:33:54,720
you obeyed your parents in everything.
啥都得听父母的

580
00:33:54,800 --> 00:33:56,400
Grown up, out in the collective,
你长大了在集体里

581
00:33:56,480 --> 00:33:58,200
of course you obeyed your leaders.
那肯定得听领导的呀

582
00:33:58,280 --> 00:34:01,400
People like us, our whole lives, we felt like...
你像我们这辈子就觉得我们那个…

583
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,680
that around us,
这个身上

584
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:04,960
there was a circle.
那是有个圈的

585
00:34:05,040 --> 00:34:06,360
We stayed right there,
我们就在那

586
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:09,080
plodding along inside that circle, step by step.
按部就班地在圈里那么走着

587
00:34:09,160 --> 00:34:10,560
Nobody asked why.
也没人问为啥

588
00:34:10,640 --> 00:34:12,680
Nobody ever wandered outside it.
也没人到圈外遛达过

589
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:15,240
Even stepping on the line was scary.
就连踩了个线都害怕

590
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:21,200
The world's changing so fast now.
现在这个世界变化也是快

591
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:23,400
Every generation has its own way of living.
哪代人都有哪代人活法

592
00:34:24,160 --> 00:34:25,640
Someday, when you have kids,
将来你有了孩子

593
00:34:26,160 --> 00:34:27,880
you might not figure them out either.
你也不一定能整明白

594
00:34:28,560 --> 00:34:29,560
But understood or not,
但是明不明白

595
00:34:29,640 --> 00:34:31,720
a father and son are always father and son.
那爷俩永远都是爷俩

596
00:34:32,720 --> 00:34:34,840
Don't hold a grudge against your dad. Hear me?
不能跟你爸记仇，听见没？

597
00:34:36,320 --> 00:34:37,760
I don't hold grudges against him.
我不跟他记仇

598
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,639
I'm not petty like him.
我可没他那么小心眼

599
00:34:39,719 --> 00:34:40,679
That's good.
那就好

600
00:34:41,199 --> 00:34:42,800
Come on, eat. Hurry up.
来，吃饭，快点

601
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:44,040
Eat something.
吃点东西

602
00:34:45,520 --> 00:34:46,520
Here.
来

603
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:49,880
Ma.
妈

604
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:52,600
I need to go out for a bit.
我想出去一趟

605
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:56,239
Eat something before you go.
你吃点东西再走

606
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:57,360
I'm good.
不吃了

607
00:35:01,679 --> 00:35:03,719
All right, go on then. Back early.
行了，那你去，早点回来呀

608
00:35:05,199 --> 00:35:06,440
I'm off, Ma.
那我去了啊，妈

609
00:35:07,760 --> 00:35:09,000
Bye, Ma.
走了啊，妈

610
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:24,639
Hey—don't go any further in.
别…别往里走了

611
00:35:24,719 --> 00:35:26,040
No late show today.
今儿没夜场

612
00:35:26,120 --> 00:35:27,480
I'm here for Shen Mo.
我找沈墨

613
00:35:28,040 --> 00:35:29,240
We made plans.
我们俩约好了

614
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:38,880
You're here this early?
怎么来这么早？

615
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:45,840
"Titanic"?
“《铁达尼号》”？

616
00:35:45,920 --> 00:35:47,160
We couldn't watch it together last time.
上次没能一起看

617
00:35:47,240 --> 00:35:48,920
Here's your chance to make up for it.
这次给你个机会补上

618
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:55,480
This is Wang Yang.
这就是王阳

619
00:35:57,160 --> 00:35:58,440
This is Fu Weijun.
这是傅卫军

620
00:35:59,200 --> 00:36:01,080
I'll go see if I can get it playing.
那我去试试能不能放

621
00:36:19,600 --> 00:36:22,840
Hey buddy, you just met Shen Mo, right?
哥们，你跟沈墨刚认识的吧？

622
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:24,160
Never heard her mention you either.
我也没听她提过你

623
00:36:27,280 --> 00:36:28,640
Hey, I'm talking to you.
我跟你说话呢

624
00:36:30,280 --> 00:36:31,440
He can't hear you.
他听不见

625
00:36:32,240 --> 00:36:33,520
You could've said so.
你早说呀

626
00:36:33,600 --> 00:36:35,080
Almost swung at him.
差点就动手了

627
00:36:56,200 --> 00:36:57,240
The hell's he mean?
他啥意思他？

628
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:58,960
My brother says you're a bit slow.
我弟说你有点傻

629
00:37:43,880 --> 00:37:45,120
Your surname's Shen.
妳姓沉

630
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:46,920
So why's your brother a Fu?
妳弟为啥姓傅啊？

631
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:50,480
My brother's a year younger.
我弟比我小一岁

632
00:37:50,560 --> 00:37:51,800
After my parents died,
我爸妈没了以后

633
00:37:51,880 --> 00:37:53,680
we went to live with my uncle.
我们俩就去了我大爷家

634
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:57,680
My aunt didn't want him—his ears were bad.
我大娘嫌他耳朵不好，不想要他

635
00:37:58,200 --> 00:38:00,600
So they gave him to a family in Hualin.
就把他给了桦林的一家人

636
00:38:00,680 --> 00:38:02,120
That family named him.
名字是那家起的

637
00:38:02,200 --> 00:38:03,600
He got used to it.
他也叫惯了

638
00:38:04,600 --> 00:38:06,320
Then that family had a kid of their own
后来那家自己要了孩子

639
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:08,120
so he went to the orphanage.
他就去了福利院

640
00:38:08,720 --> 00:38:11,400
I tested into Hualin Med just to see him.
我往桦医考也是因为能见着他

641
00:38:13,240 --> 00:38:15,000
He's the only family I've got left.
我就他这么一个亲人了

642
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:19,960
Isn't there one more now?
现在不是又多了一个吗？

643
00:39:09,600 --> 00:39:10,640
Cui Guodong.
崔国栋

644
00:39:13,240 --> 00:39:14,400
Down here.
在下边呢

645
00:39:16,640 --> 00:39:17,840
Who found it?
谁发现的？

646
00:39:17,920 --> 00:39:19,160
The patrol team.
联防队的

647
00:39:19,680 --> 00:39:21,600
-Right in this drainage ditch.
-Let me.
-就在这斗沟里边
-我来

648
00:39:21,680 --> 00:39:22,760
Easy there.
你慢点

649
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:24,520
Move, let me see.
躲开我看看

650
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:26,800
Step aside.
往边上点

651
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:29,600
Didn't you mark some underground drain points?
你不是划了几片地下管道排污点吗？

652
00:39:30,080 --> 00:39:32,320
Had the patrol team sweep them for us.
安排联防队的帮咱们扫了

653
00:39:33,080 --> 00:39:34,560
They just got to this spot.
刚扫到这地方

654
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:36,920
That Wang Xiang, huh.
行呀，这王响

655
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:51,680
What is it?
怎么的了？

656
00:39:54,080 --> 00:39:56,080
This killer's a fucking monster.
这凶手太他妈没人性了

657
00:40:04,280 --> 00:40:06,080
Found a backpack in the pipe too.
管道里还找到一个书包

658
00:40:06,600 --> 00:40:08,440
Inside's a meal card from Hualin Med.
包里有一张桦医的饭卡

659
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:15,640
Leave the feelings out. Work.
别带情绪，干活

660
00:40:18,240 --> 00:40:19,160
Move along...
散了…

661
00:40:19,680 --> 00:40:20,720
Stop looking.
别看了

662
00:40:24,040 --> 00:40:25,280
Search it real careful.
查仔细点呀

663
00:40:59,680 --> 00:41:02,000
Reading this junk all day—how'll you get into college?
净看这破玩意，能考上大学？

664
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:07,080
("The Death of Ah Lu")
（《阿橹之死》）

665
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:11,480
"At a moment like this
“这样的时刻

666
00:41:11,560 --> 00:41:14,040
let me die before my father
让我殇于父亲之前

667
00:41:14,560 --> 00:41:17,120
let my mother, with her final elegy,
让母亲以挽歌的绝唱

668
00:41:17,200 --> 00:41:21,120
keep vigil for me, and for the earth's four seasons"
为我，也为大地上的四季守眠”

669
00:41:22,880 --> 00:41:24,360
What kinda crap poem is this?
啥破诗呀？

670
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:25,840
No meter, no rhyme.
不合辙，不押韵的

671
00:41:30,160 --> 00:41:31,320
Where'd it go?
哪去了呢？

672
00:41:47,720 --> 00:41:48,680
Good Lord.
妈呀

673
00:41:49,240 --> 00:41:51,200
This room looks like it got robbed.
这屋怎么跟进贼了似的呢？

674
00:41:51,720 --> 00:41:52,800
Dad.
爸

675
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:54,560
What's this thing doing here?
这玩意怎么在这呢？

676
00:41:54,640 --> 00:41:56,520
I haven't used it in years.
我多少年都不用它了

677
00:41:58,520 --> 00:42:00,800
Wore it hiking with Qu Bo a couple days back.
前两天我跟曲波爬山的时候穿来着

678
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:02,280
This thing beats the cold.
这衣服抗冻

679
00:42:02,360 --> 00:42:03,400
Hiking what?
爬啥山呢？

680
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:05,120
A snow mountain?
雪山啊？

681
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:08,280
Where's our old map gone?
咱家老地图哪去了呢？

682
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:10,000
I remember sticking it in a cookbook.
我记着夹到一个菜谱里头了

683
00:42:10,680 --> 00:42:11,800
It's up here.
在这上面呢

684
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:15,800
What's it doing up there?
你放那干啥玩意你？

685
00:42:18,920 --> 00:42:19,880
No—
不是

686
00:42:19,960 --> 00:42:21,680
What do you want the map for?
你找地图干啥呀？

687
00:42:21,760 --> 00:42:22,840
The dismemberment case.
碎尸案的事

688
00:42:22,920 --> 00:42:25,160
Helping the police canvass the plant.
帮警方在厂里搞搞排查

689
00:42:25,240 --> 00:42:27,080
I'm briefing Xing San and his bunch.
我给邢三儿他们开个会

690
00:42:27,160 --> 00:42:28,680
Wait, you're skipping lunch?
不是，你不吃午饭呀？

691
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:31,200
This matters more than lunch.
这个事比吃饭的事大

692
00:42:31,840 --> 00:42:33,560
You never stop, do you?
一天不够你忙活的

693
00:42:44,480 --> 00:42:45,560
Master Wang.
王师傅

694
00:42:46,080 --> 00:42:48,440
That train sits any longer, it'll rust shut.
火车再不开，都要上锈了吧

695
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:50,520
Relax.
放心吧

696
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:53,960
With me around, not even a lug nut rusts.
有我在，螺丝帽都上不了锈

697
00:42:54,040 --> 00:42:55,400
It'll outlive you.
你活不过它

698
00:43:00,240 --> 00:43:01,640
Isn't that Security's kettle?
这不保卫科的壶吗？

699
00:43:01,720 --> 00:43:02,960
New post, Master Wang?
转岗了，王师傅？

700
00:43:03,840 --> 00:43:05,680
Been given other duties lately.
最近抓点别的工作

701
00:43:05,760 --> 00:43:07,120
Giving Security some training.
给保卫科上上课

702
00:43:07,680 --> 00:43:08,680
You? Training them?
你给他们上课？

703
00:43:09,400 --> 00:43:11,560
Gotta lecture your workshop sometime too.
什么时候给你们车间也上上课

704
00:43:12,120 --> 00:43:13,600
The title:
题目就是…

705
00:43:13,680 --> 00:43:16,640
"Stay Alert, Keep Your Eyes Peeled"
“提高警惕，擦亮双眼”

706
00:43:42,600 --> 00:43:44,240
No manners at all.
什么素质这？

707
00:43:47,920 --> 00:43:49,080
Master Wang.
王师傅

708
00:43:49,960 --> 00:43:50,920
Don't go.
别走啊

709
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:52,560
The meeting hasn't started.
这会还没开呢

710
00:43:52,640 --> 00:43:53,800
Where is everyone?
人呢？

711
00:43:54,520 --> 00:43:56,400
Meeting's at one. Where's Security?
一点钟开会，保卫科的人呢？

712
00:43:58,360 --> 00:43:59,240
Master Wang.
王师傅

713
00:43:59,320 --> 00:44:00,960
Thing is, Captain Ma just called me.
这不我刚才接到马队长电话了吗？

714
00:44:01,520 --> 00:44:03,920
Says the plant sweep's gotta be us two teamed up.
说咱们厂的摸排还得是咱俩配合

715
00:44:04,000 --> 00:44:05,360
The moment I heard that,
我这一听

716
00:44:05,960 --> 00:44:07,120
I felt solid.
心里有底了

717
00:44:07,200 --> 00:44:08,720
Cut the crap.
别整用不着的

718
00:44:08,800 --> 00:44:10,400
About our internal sweep,
关于咱们内部摸排的事

719
00:44:10,480 --> 00:44:11,800
here's my thinking.
我是这么考虑的

720
00:44:11,880 --> 00:44:12,920
Master Wang,
王师傅

721
00:44:13,600 --> 00:44:15,320
here's where things stand.
现在有这么个情况

722
00:44:17,800 --> 00:44:20,640
We've picked up a bit of his trail.
我们现在已经摸着他一点边了

723
00:44:23,800 --> 00:44:24,640
Who?
谁啊？

724
00:44:24,720 --> 00:44:26,240
Don't know who he is yet.
还不知道他是谁

725
00:44:26,320 --> 00:44:29,280
But looks like the killer did show his face in our plant.
但凶手好像还真在咱们厂里冒过头

726
00:44:35,040 --> 00:44:36,720
Why's Security empty?
咱保卫科为啥没人？

727
00:44:44,560 --> 00:44:46,200
All out manning the net.
都去布控去了

728
00:44:46,960 --> 00:44:47,800
The net?
布控？

729
00:44:47,880 --> 00:44:48,800
That's right.
对了

730
00:44:54,680 --> 00:44:56,920
Well? Find anything?
怎么样？ 有啥发现没有？

731
00:44:57,000 --> 00:44:58,200
Nothing.
没发现

732
00:44:58,280 --> 00:44:59,400
Dazhi,
大志呀

733
00:44:59,480 --> 00:45:01,000
tell Master Wang
你给王师傅讲讲

734
00:45:01,080 --> 00:45:02,600
everything you saw that night.
你那天晚上都看着啥了

735
00:45:04,440 --> 00:45:06,200
So, that night,
就那天晚上吧

736
00:45:06,280 --> 00:45:07,440
I'd just come off shift.
我刚交完班

737
00:45:08,360 --> 00:45:10,600
Carrying my stuff, figuring I'd hit the baths.
我拎着东西，我寻思去搓个澡呢

738
00:45:10,680 --> 00:45:13,760
I'm walking along by the furnaces, walking...
我顺着炉子那边，我就走啊走

739
00:45:14,320 --> 00:45:15,560
walking...
走啊走

740
00:45:16,040 --> 00:45:17,400
when all of a sudden
突然之间

741
00:45:18,040 --> 00:45:19,920
I hear a noise.
我就听着点啥动静

742
00:45:22,040 --> 00:45:22,960
What noise?
什么动静？

743
00:45:23,040 --> 00:45:26,200
When I stop, it stops.
就是我一停，他就没声了

744
00:45:26,680 --> 00:45:28,360
When I walk, it walks too.
我一走，他也跟着走

745
00:45:29,760 --> 00:45:32,320
So I look up along the furnace.
我就顺那炉子，我就往那一看

746
00:45:33,280 --> 00:45:34,360
And?
啥呀？

747
00:45:34,440 --> 00:45:36,240
There's a guy in a protective suit
我看见那人穿个防护服

748
00:45:36,320 --> 00:45:37,520
standing on top of the furnace.
在炉子上面站着呢

749
00:45:38,480 --> 00:45:39,560
He turns around—
他一回身

750
00:45:40,400 --> 00:45:41,720
the face is blank.
脸是空的

751
00:45:43,920 --> 00:45:45,400
Blank face?
脸是空的？

752
00:45:46,440 --> 00:45:47,320
Bullshit.
瞎扯呢

753
00:45:47,400 --> 00:45:50,080
If I'm lying, I'm a bastard.
我要撒一句谎，我是这个

754
00:45:50,920 --> 00:45:52,800
Wait—you couldn't see his face at all.
不是，你五官啥都看不见

755
00:45:52,880 --> 00:45:54,760
So how do you figure he's the killer?
你根据啥判断他是凶手呢？

756
00:45:54,840 --> 00:45:57,080
-Well, it's...
-Yeah, based on what?
-那不是…
-根据啥吧

757
00:45:57,160 --> 00:45:58,240
Think about it.
你想呀

758
00:45:58,320 --> 00:46:00,800
A guy who cuts a person into slices—
那人能把这个人切成一片一片的

759
00:46:00,880 --> 00:46:02,040
you telling me he ain't evil?
你说他恶不恶？

760
00:46:02,120 --> 00:46:04,120
There's a killing aura on his head.
那脑瓜顶都带煞气呀

761
00:46:04,200 --> 00:46:05,520
Dazhi saw it. Did you?
大志瞅见了，你瞅见没有？

762
00:46:06,200 --> 00:46:07,240
See?
你看看

763
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:13,120
Can't see his face, but you saw an aura?
五官啥都看不见，能看着煞气？

764
00:46:13,640 --> 00:46:15,800
This is pointless. You two, beat it.
扯别的没有用，你俩先撤吧

765
00:46:17,160 --> 00:46:19,160
Wang Xiang, listen to me.
王响，我跟你讲

766
00:46:19,680 --> 00:46:21,200
He came once.
这人能来第一回

767
00:46:21,280 --> 00:46:23,320
No guarantee he won't come twice.
他就保不齐还能来第二回

768
00:46:24,120 --> 00:46:26,320
I've thrown all of Security out there.
我把保卫科的人都给派出去了

769
00:46:26,840 --> 00:46:27,960
Every plant gate,
各厂厂口

770
00:46:28,040 --> 00:46:29,400
every main road—
各主要交通干道

771
00:46:29,480 --> 00:46:31,200
if it can be covered, I've covered it.
能布的我都给它布上

772
00:46:31,280 --> 00:46:33,320
Male, under 180 cm,
男的，不到180公分

773
00:46:33,400 --> 00:46:35,160
killing aura on his head.
脑袋顶上带煞气

774
00:46:35,240 --> 00:46:37,360
Under 180 cm, male,
不到180公分，男的

775
00:46:37,440 --> 00:46:38,760
aura on the head.
脑袋有煞气

776
00:46:38,840 --> 00:46:41,320
This plant's got 800 of those, easy.
我们厂没一千，有八百

777
00:46:41,400 --> 00:46:43,680
People can barely eat—who ain't got an aura?
饭都快吃不上了，能没煞气吗？

778
00:46:46,520 --> 00:46:49,520
Wang Xiang, you're an old-timer of this plant.
王响，你是咱厂的老同志

779
00:46:49,600 --> 00:46:51,240
Show a little awareness.
你得有点觉悟呀

780
00:46:51,320 --> 00:46:55,160
The smelting shop is the prime spot he was seen.
冶炼车间 可是看着那个人的第一案发现场

781
00:46:55,240 --> 00:46:57,080
I'm saving it for you.
我把它留给你了

782
00:46:58,160 --> 00:47:00,000
Why not report straight to Captain Ma?
不是，为啥不直接汇报给马队呢？

783
00:47:00,080 --> 00:47:01,720
It's just your word, no proof.
你口说无凭吧

784
00:47:01,800 --> 00:47:03,360
So? You staking this spot or not?
你就说这个点你蹲不蹲

785
00:47:03,440 --> 00:47:05,000
-You won't, I hand it to someone else.
-What?
-你不蹲，我现在交给别人
-什么？

786
00:47:05,080 --> 00:47:07,160
Who says I won't? Course I'll stake it!
干什么不蹲呢？ 怎么就不蹲呢？

787
00:47:10,840 --> 00:47:14,400
But what would the killer want at the smelting shop?
问题是这凶手到这冶炼车间干啥呀？

788
00:47:14,480 --> 00:47:16,920
Catch him and ask him yourself.
一会你抓着他了，你自己问他

789
00:47:18,720 --> 00:47:20,520
-What's this?
-What? A whistle.
-啥呀？
-啥？ 哨啊

790
00:47:20,600 --> 00:47:21,720
What for?
干啥呀？

791
00:47:21,800 --> 00:47:23,640
Blow it the second you spot something.
吹吧，一会你发现有啥情况了

792
00:47:23,720 --> 00:47:25,240
Backup swarms in from all directions.
这四面八方增援呀

793
00:47:25,320 --> 00:47:26,200
Here.
拿着

794
00:47:26,680 --> 00:47:27,840
You take a two-hour watch.
你蹲俩点

795
00:47:27,920 --> 00:47:28,840
I'll come relieve you.
我过来换你

796
00:48:10,000 --> 00:48:10,880
You?
你？

797
00:48:13,840 --> 00:48:14,720
You?
你？

798
00:48:19,360 --> 00:48:21,040
Ten to ace, pair of sevens.
十到A，俩七

799
00:48:21,120 --> 00:48:22,360
Lemme see your hand.
我看你牌

800
00:48:22,440 --> 00:48:24,120
-Damn.
-You're short a pair of twos.
-我去
-你这差俩二

801
00:48:24,200 --> 00:48:26,120
You play like absolute garbage.
你这牌打得稀烂稀烂的

802
00:48:26,200 --> 00:48:27,960
-Again... deal.
-Come on... Chief Xing.
-来…再来
-来…邢科

803
00:48:30,720 --> 00:48:32,480
There's still a guy in the smelting shop.
熔链车间里还有个人呢

804
00:48:33,120 --> 00:48:34,840
What? You wanna cover his shift?
怎么的？ 你想替他班呀？

805
00:48:34,920 --> 00:48:36,160
Not a chance.
我可不去

806
00:48:36,760 --> 00:48:38,400
He dreams of earning glory, don't he?
不作梦都想立功吗？

807
00:48:38,480 --> 00:48:39,520
Let him snap out of it.
让他清醒清醒

808
00:48:40,080 --> 00:48:42,840
A lousy driver reaching into my Security Section.
你一个臭开车的 你把手伸我保卫科来

809
00:48:43,560 --> 00:48:44,840
City Bureau? So what?
你市局怎么的？

810
00:48:45,560 --> 00:48:47,280
Detective captain? So what?
你刑警队长怎么的？

811
00:48:47,360 --> 00:48:48,600
I'm fucking laying it down here:
我他妈把话撂这

812
00:48:48,680 --> 00:48:51,080
inside Hualin Steel, none of it flies.
只要是在桦钢，不管用

813
00:48:51,160 --> 00:48:52,920
-Third Brother's the man...
-Exactly.
-三哥厉害…
-就是

814
00:48:53,000 --> 00:48:54,000
Damn right.
就是

815
00:48:54,760 --> 00:48:55,760
Chief Xing.
邢科

816
00:48:57,000 --> 00:48:59,840
But what if Dazhi really saw the killer?
万一大志看着的真是凶手呢？

817
00:48:59,920 --> 00:49:01,880
Would a real killer get caught by him?
真凶手能让他抓着呀？

818
00:49:02,800 --> 00:49:04,240
He's playing a cute little game
算盘打得挺好呀

819
00:49:04,840 --> 00:49:06,440
thinks this'll be his big comeback.
还想靠这个翻身呢

820
00:49:09,440 --> 00:49:10,520
Liru.
丽茹

821
00:49:11,480 --> 00:49:12,560
Liru.
丽茹

822
00:49:14,000 --> 00:49:14,840
Here.
来

823
00:49:17,720 --> 00:49:19,160
What took you so long?
你怎么才来呀？

824
00:49:19,240 --> 00:49:20,920
I rushed over from your hospital.
我从妳医院那赶过来的

825
00:49:21,000 --> 00:49:23,360
My hospital? We said we'd meet here.
上我医院干啥？ 不约在这见面吗？

826
00:49:23,440 --> 00:49:25,480
Something came up at the plant office.
厂办有点突发状况

827
00:49:26,080 --> 00:49:29,040
Old Zhao—Director Zhao—got jumped by two workers in the canteen.
那老赵赵主任 让俩工人堵食堂里一顿揍

828
00:49:29,600 --> 00:49:31,080
Blood spraying everywhere.
那血哗哗往外滋

829
00:49:31,160 --> 00:49:32,800
I was out the door and they called me back.
我都出来了，又给我叫回去了

830
00:49:32,880 --> 00:49:34,760
Those office guys can't handle shit.
就厂办那几个也不扛事呀

831
00:49:35,240 --> 00:49:37,280
I don't go back, it all falls apart.
那我不回去，控制不了局面

832
00:49:38,680 --> 00:49:41,120
I'm off work. Spare me the plant talk.
我都下班了，不想听厂里那些事了

833
00:49:42,000 --> 00:49:44,000
Sorry—kept you waiting till you starved.
不好意思呀，让妳等饿了

834
00:49:44,760 --> 00:49:45,800
You only bought one?
就买一个呀

835
00:49:45,880 --> 00:49:47,160
We watching the movie or not?
电影还看不看？

836
00:49:48,120 --> 00:49:50,120
We are. I picked it special.
看呢，这片我特意选的

837
00:49:50,680 --> 00:49:52,560
A love story. Real romantic.
搞对象的，特浪漫

838
00:49:52,640 --> 00:49:54,800
Hang on, let me park my bike.
妳等我一下，我停个车呀

839
00:50:00,120 --> 00:50:01,280
Where'd you get that roast sweet potato?
妳那烤地瓜在哪买的？

840
00:50:01,360 --> 00:50:02,680
Get me one too.
也帮我买一个吧

841
00:50:19,440 --> 00:50:20,920
Some pick...
这片选的

842
00:50:21,000 --> 00:50:23,720
Never knew romance could be like this.
没想到这么搞对象呀

843
00:50:24,560 --> 00:50:27,960
From the title, I figured Yu Dafu, Lin Huiyin, that stuff.
看片名我以为讲郁达夫、林徽因啥的

844
00:50:29,160 --> 00:50:30,800
It's pretty romantic, actually.
这片挺浪漫的

845
00:50:32,040 --> 00:50:34,440
Just a bit shaky. Making me dizzy.
就是有点晃，迷糊

846
00:50:36,680 --> 00:50:39,560
That actor kinda looks like you.
我瞅这男演员长的跟你还有点像呢

847
00:50:40,480 --> 00:50:41,440
Oh yeah?
是吗？

848
00:50:43,400 --> 00:50:45,600
People used to say I belonged in the movies.
以前他们老说我适合拍电影

849
00:50:46,760 --> 00:50:49,200
Then I went all-in on academics. Missed the boat.
后来一心搞学术，耽误了

850
00:50:54,400 --> 00:50:57,200
Did my brother-in-law tell you my basics?
姐夫跟妳說我的基本情况了吗？

851
00:50:58,680 --> 00:50:59,760
Who?
谁？

852
00:51:01,000 --> 00:51:02,240
Master Wang.
王师傅

853
00:51:06,920 --> 00:51:08,800
He... didn't really say much.
也…也没怎么说

854
00:51:14,400 --> 00:51:15,880
Well, here's the deal.
是这么个情况

855
00:51:16,480 --> 00:51:19,840
Career first, then family, right?
不都说先立业再成家吗？

856
00:51:21,080 --> 00:51:25,440
I'm right in the rising phase of my career.
我现在就是正好处在事业的上升期

857
00:51:26,080 --> 00:51:28,920
Plant office, after Director Zhao, it's me.
那厂办除了赵主任，也就我了

858
00:51:37,640 --> 00:51:39,640
Speak normally. I can hear you.
你正常说话，我能听见

859
00:51:42,480 --> 00:51:44,320
Freud said it:
佛洛伊德说过吧

860
00:51:45,120 --> 00:51:48,440
"A mentally healthy person can do two things:
“一个精神健康的人都能做到两件事

861
00:51:49,200 --> 00:51:50,520
work with devotion
认真工作

862
00:51:50,600 --> 00:51:51,920
and love"
以及爱人”

863
00:51:52,840 --> 00:51:54,040
On the work front,
工作这一块

864
00:51:54,120 --> 00:51:56,640
I've basically left everyone in the dust.
我基本上已经做到一骑绝尘了

865
00:51:57,440 --> 00:51:59,760
All that's left is love.
现在就差爱人了

866
00:52:00,560 --> 00:52:02,000
Who's Freud?
谁是佛洛伊德呀？

867
00:52:02,880 --> 00:52:04,360
A scholar.
一个学者

868
00:52:04,440 --> 00:52:06,280
Studies dreams, mostly.
主要研究作梦的

869
00:52:06,360 --> 00:52:07,560
He get an apartment?
他分房了吗？

870
00:52:08,600 --> 00:52:10,920
Nope. He's not with our plant.
那没有，他不是咱厂的

871
00:52:11,640 --> 00:52:12,760
Did you get one?
你分房了吗？

872
00:52:13,280 --> 00:52:14,360
Any day now.
指日可待了

873
00:52:16,080 --> 00:52:19,600
Old Zhao and I have explored the matter in depth.
我和老赵为这事已经深入地探讨过了

874
00:52:20,800 --> 00:52:22,120
You see,
妳不知道

875
00:52:22,200 --> 00:52:24,560
Director Song values talent.
宋厂长那人爱才

876
00:52:24,640 --> 00:52:26,320
With my work ability,
以我的工作能力

877
00:52:26,400 --> 00:52:28,520
the next round's no problem.
赶上下一拨问题不大

878
00:52:36,800 --> 00:52:37,800
Liru.
丽茹

879
00:52:38,360 --> 00:52:40,720
So, on the dating front,
这个处对象这块

880
00:52:40,800 --> 00:52:42,240
what's your type?
妳喜欢啥类型的？

881
00:52:46,400 --> 00:52:48,360
I like the mature type.
我喜欢成熟型的

882
00:52:48,440 --> 00:52:50,080
Then I've got a huge edge.
那这一点我太有优势了

883
00:52:53,320 --> 00:52:54,840
What edge?
你有啥优势呀？

884
00:52:54,920 --> 00:52:57,440
People say I look a bit old for my age.
他们都说我多少有点显老

885
00:53:04,600 --> 00:53:06,560
Watch the movie. Stop squirming.
你看电影吧，别老动弹

886
00:53:06,640 --> 00:53:07,840
Your hair.
妳头发

887
00:53:11,800 --> 00:53:13,240
What's so good about it?
有啥好看的呀？

888
00:53:13,320 --> 00:53:15,840
Two grown men rolling around up there.
俩大老爷们在上面动来动去的

889
00:53:21,000 --> 00:53:22,200
Liru.
丽茹

890
00:53:22,280 --> 00:53:24,080
Wait up—I'll see you home.
妳等我一下，我送妳呀

891
00:53:31,080 --> 00:53:32,360
Hop on.
上车

892
00:53:32,440 --> 00:53:33,800
Aren't you heading back to the workers' dorm?
你不回青工宿舍吗？

893
00:53:33,880 --> 00:53:35,080
It's not on your way.
咱俩不顺路

894
00:53:35,640 --> 00:53:36,960
Isn't the earth round?
地球不是圆的吗？

895
00:53:37,040 --> 00:53:39,240
Off-route or not, a few extra steps gets me there.
再不顺路，多走两步也到了

896
00:53:40,080 --> 00:53:41,440
Really, no need. Thanks.
真不用了，谢谢呀

897
00:53:42,120 --> 00:53:44,000
Let's pick another movie sometime.
哪天咱再选个片看吧

898
00:53:44,480 --> 00:53:46,320
We'll see. I'm off.
回头再说吧，我先走了

899
00:53:55,120 --> 00:53:57,000
Who pulled my valve core?
谁把我气门芯拔了？

900
00:53:58,160 --> 00:53:59,960
Sweet potato man—did you see who?
卖烤地瓜的，你看见没？

901
00:54:50,120 --> 00:54:51,200
Master Wang.
王师傅

902
00:55:00,960 --> 00:55:02,360
Master Wang, you hungry?
王师傅，你饿不？

903
00:55:02,960 --> 00:55:05,640
Let's go find a spot to eat.
咱俩出去找个地方吃点啊

904
00:55:08,000 --> 00:55:09,280
Stand up first.
你先站起来

905
00:55:10,360 --> 00:55:11,400
What's wrong?
怎么了？

906
00:55:15,920 --> 00:55:16,800
Turn around.
转一圈

907
00:55:21,600 --> 00:55:22,640
What are you doing?
干啥呀？

908
00:55:22,720 --> 00:55:23,560
How tall?
多高？

909
00:55:23,640 --> 00:55:24,720
180 centimeters.
180公分

910
00:55:25,440 --> 00:55:26,640
Really?
有吗？

911
00:55:26,720 --> 00:55:28,440
178.5 barefoot.
净量178.5公分

912
00:55:28,520 --> 00:55:29,680
180 in heels.
穿带跟的180公分

913
00:55:31,080 --> 00:55:32,680
I mean, you...
你说你

914
00:55:33,760 --> 00:55:35,560
You're a factory office guy.
一个厂办的

915
00:55:36,400 --> 00:55:38,480
Why wear smelter overalls?
穿着个冶炼的工作服干啥玩意？

916
00:55:38,560 --> 00:55:39,960
Isn't that a safety hazard?
不安全生产吗？

917
00:55:40,440 --> 00:55:42,440
Don't you need work clothes in the smelter?
那不进冶炼不都得穿工作服吗？

918
00:55:43,360 --> 00:55:44,720
You play it real safe.
活得挺仔细

919
00:55:45,480 --> 00:55:46,560
Sit down.
坐下吧

920
00:55:55,720 --> 00:55:57,120
How did you know I was here?
你怎么知道我在这呢？

921
00:55:57,200 --> 00:55:59,080
I went to the locomotive depot for you.
我去机务段找你去了

922
00:55:59,160 --> 00:56:00,920
They said you were at a Security Section meeting.
说你给保卫科开会去了

923
00:56:01,000 --> 00:56:02,680
So I went to Security for you.
我又去保卫科找你

924
00:56:02,760 --> 00:56:04,520
They told me to check the overhead crane.
说让我到航吊这找找

925
00:56:04,600 --> 00:56:06,920
And I actually dug you out here.
没想到真到这把你给扒拉出来了

926
00:56:08,360 --> 00:56:09,240
Is that how you talk?
会说话不？

927
00:56:10,440 --> 00:56:12,240
Who says "dug out" about finding someone?
你家找人叫扒拉啊？

928
00:56:12,320 --> 00:56:13,560
That's not what I meant.
不是那意思

929
00:56:15,840 --> 00:56:17,320
-This is "digging out."
-Yeah.
-这叫扒拉
-是

930
00:56:20,160 --> 00:56:22,280
Besides, I revealed myself on purpose.
另外，我是主动暴露目标

931
00:56:22,360 --> 00:56:23,640
Otherwise, could you have found me?
要不然你能找着我呀？

932
00:56:23,720 --> 00:56:24,880
Right...
是…

933
00:56:24,960 --> 00:56:26,320
You were so well hidden.
你那多隐蔽呀

934
00:56:26,400 --> 00:56:28,400
I... I just misspoke.
我…我用词不当了嘛

935
00:56:32,320 --> 00:56:34,080
Stop eating that lousy potato.
这破土豆子别吃了

936
00:56:34,760 --> 00:56:37,000
Let's go find a place to eat and talk.
咱俩出去找个地方边吃边聊吧

937
00:56:37,080 --> 00:56:38,200
My treat.
我请你

938
00:56:39,480 --> 00:56:40,680
No merit, no reward.
无功不受禄

939
00:56:42,280 --> 00:56:43,640
Why are you treating me?
你请我吃啥饭？

940
00:56:46,960 --> 00:56:48,600
It's about me and Liru.
我和丽茹那事嘛

941
00:56:49,360 --> 00:56:51,040
Put in another push for me.
你再帮我再使使劲吧

942
00:56:51,120 --> 00:56:52,440
You need my push?
用我使劲呀？

943
00:56:53,040 --> 00:56:54,760
Didn't you take her to a movie?
不看电影去了吗？

944
00:56:55,320 --> 00:56:56,400
Don't bring it up.
别提了

945
00:56:57,400 --> 00:56:59,920
The movie choice was a bit of a mistake.
那片选得多少有点失误呀

946
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:01,360
Was that the movie's fault?
那是片的事吗？

947
00:57:04,480 --> 00:57:05,960
No, Master Wang.
不是，王师傅

948
00:57:06,040 --> 00:57:07,280
Would I let you help for nothing?
我能让你白帮忙吗？

949
00:57:13,120 --> 00:57:14,760
Where'd this liquor come from?
这酒哪来的呀？

950
00:57:14,840 --> 00:57:16,000
Old Song gave it to me.
老宋给的

951
00:57:21,280 --> 00:57:24,760
Song Yukun gave you liquor?
宋玉坤送你的酒？

952
00:57:24,840 --> 00:57:27,680
I got my classmate to tutor his son in English.
我找我同学给他儿子补外语嘛

953
00:57:27,760 --> 00:57:28,640
Didn't take money.
没收钱

954
00:57:28,720 --> 00:57:30,120
So he gave me this.
他给我的

955
00:57:30,200 --> 00:57:31,800
Said this liquor's got age.
说这酒有年头了

956
00:57:32,560 --> 00:57:34,640
By age, it'd be your elder.
论年头，你得管它叫大爷

957
00:57:35,200 --> 00:57:37,560
As long as you fix things with Liru and me,
只要你把我跟丽茹的事整明白了

958
00:57:37,640 --> 00:57:39,000
I'd call it Grandpa.
我叫它爷爷都行

959
00:57:39,080 --> 00:57:39,920
Seriously.
真的

960
00:57:40,000 --> 00:57:41,680
Is the factory office busy these days?
厂办现在忙不忙？

961
00:57:42,360 --> 00:57:43,440
Why?
怎么了？

962
00:57:44,480 --> 00:57:47,840
If not—I'm canvassing the factory now, right?
要不忙的话 我现在不是在厂里摸排吗？

963
00:57:47,920 --> 00:57:49,200
Lend me a hand.
你帮我搭个手

964
00:57:49,840 --> 00:57:51,760
Sure, no problem.
行呀，没问题呀

965
00:57:52,360 --> 00:57:53,920
Point, and I'll strike.
你指哪，我打哪

966
00:57:55,320 --> 00:57:56,640
Then about me and Liru...
那我跟丽茹那事

967
00:57:58,120 --> 00:57:59,200
Just wait for word.
听信吧

968
00:58:00,960 --> 00:58:02,160
Is it done?
熟了吗？

969
00:58:03,000 --> 00:58:04,320
Break off a piece for me to taste.
掰一块我尝尝

970
00:58:10,040 --> 00:58:11,240
So good.
真香呀

971
00:58:53,520 --> 00:58:54,400
Captain Ma.
马队

972
00:58:54,880 --> 00:58:56,720
This is Shen Mo's counselor.
这是沈墨的辅导员

973
00:58:57,240 --> 00:58:59,000
-Ma Desheng, Criminal Police.
-Hello.
-刑警队马德胜
-你好

974
00:58:59,080 --> 00:59:00,200
Well?
怎么样？

975
00:59:00,280 --> 00:59:01,760
Is it Shen Mo's?
是沈墨的东西吗？

976
00:59:03,160 --> 00:59:04,960
Well... let's sit and talk.
那什么…咱坐下说吧

977
00:59:05,880 --> 00:59:08,360
Shen Mo tested in from Songhe.
沈墨是从松河考上来的

978
00:59:09,000 --> 00:59:10,960
She never talked much.
平时话也不太多

979
00:59:11,520 --> 00:59:12,840
A quiet girl.
挺安静一女孩

980
00:59:13,440 --> 00:59:15,880
Grades above average, I'd say.
学习成绩中上水平吧

981
00:59:15,960 --> 00:59:17,880
Never gave us much worry.
也没怎么让我们操过心

982
00:59:17,960 --> 00:59:19,840
But a while back,
但是前一段时间

983
00:59:20,480 --> 00:59:22,360
something unusual came up.
有个挺特殊的情况

984
00:59:25,160 --> 00:59:26,360
What situation?
啥情况呀？

985
00:59:31,960 --> 00:59:33,280
What? You can't say?
怎么？ 不能说呀？

986
01:00:00,160 --> 01:00:01,120
Where'd these come from?
哪来的？

987
01:00:01,800 --> 01:00:03,200
Early on the 20th,
20号一早

988
01:00:03,280 --> 01:00:05,560
these photos and the report letter
这些照片和举报信

989
01:00:05,640 --> 01:00:09,560
were posted on the school cafeteria bulletin board.
就贴在学校食堂的那个宣传栏上

990
01:00:09,640 --> 01:00:11,560
The letter also said
信里还说

991
01:00:12,360 --> 01:00:17,840
Shen Mo worked as a call girl in a sex venue.
沈墨在色情场所当小姐

992
01:00:17,920 --> 01:00:19,480
Drinking and sleeping with clients.
陪酒、陪睡

993
01:00:19,560 --> 01:00:21,320
Why wasn't it reported?
怎么没报警呀？

994
01:00:22,920 --> 01:00:27,080
School leaders feared it would hurt the school's name.
校领导说怕这事影响学校声誉

995
01:00:34,880 --> 01:00:37,560
Some students also told me before
之前有一些同学也跟我反映过

996
01:00:37,640 --> 01:00:39,880
her off-campus ties were complicated too.
沈墨在校外的关系也挺复杂

997
01:00:39,960 --> 01:00:42,760
A boy kept coming to school for her.
有个男孩老来学校找她

998
01:00:42,840 --> 01:00:45,920
Right... that kid even wrote a self-criticism at our office.
对…那小子还来我们教务处写过检查

999
01:01:16,400 --> 01:01:18,360
Master Wang, let's call it a day.
王师傅，今天到这吧

1000
01:01:19,240 --> 01:01:21,360
The office might look for me—I should head back.
我怕厂办找我，我得回去了

1001
01:01:26,320 --> 01:01:28,280
What the hell? That's filthy.
什么玩意？ 太脏了吧

1002
01:01:31,560 --> 01:01:33,640
Easy—this is quality fabric.
你轻点，我这料子的我这

1003
01:01:37,840 --> 01:01:39,040
Shine it further in.
往里边照

1004
01:01:39,880 --> 01:01:40,760
Shine it further in.
往里边照

1005
01:01:40,840 --> 01:01:42,000
Further in.
往里

1006
01:01:42,080 --> 01:01:43,000
That's the limit.
极限了

1007
01:01:43,680 --> 01:01:44,920
This one...
就这个…

1008
01:01:45,000 --> 01:01:46,280
Don't move. This one.
别动，就这个

1009
01:02:23,600 --> 01:02:24,560
Master Wang.
王师傅

1010
01:02:25,360 --> 01:02:26,440
Master Wang.
王师傅

1011
01:02:26,520 --> 01:02:27,480
Over here.
在这呢

1012
01:02:28,040 --> 01:02:29,280
Something's happened, Master Wang.
出事了，王师傅

1013
01:02:29,360 --> 01:02:30,280
What is it?
怎么的了？

1014
01:02:30,760 --> 01:02:31,600
Your wife called.
嫂子打电话

1015
01:02:31,680 --> 01:02:33,520
Said your son was taken by the police.
说你儿子被公安局给带走了

1016
01:02:36,160 --> 01:02:38,360
(Hualin Municipal Public Security Bureau)
（桦林市公安局）

1017
01:02:38,440 --> 01:02:43,800
(The People's Police Serve the People)
（人民公安为人民）

1018
01:03:04,280 --> 01:03:05,360
What's going on?
怎么回事？

1019
01:03:06,720 --> 01:03:08,360
I'm asking you what's going on.
问你怎么回事

1020
01:03:08,440 --> 01:03:10,640
Master Wang, don't panic yet.
王师傅，先别着急呢

1021
01:03:11,360 --> 01:03:12,320
There's a case.
有个案子

1022
01:03:12,400 --> 01:03:13,960
We brought him in to ask some questions.
找他过来了解一下情况

1023
01:03:14,040 --> 01:03:15,880
We're done. Take him home.
都问完了，领他回去吧

1024
01:03:17,080 --> 01:03:18,080
What case?
什么案子？

1025
01:03:18,800 --> 01:03:19,720
What case?
什么案子？

1026
01:03:20,280 --> 01:03:21,440
What case?
什么案子？

1027
01:03:24,760 --> 01:03:25,840
Stay there.
站那

1028
01:03:26,680 --> 01:03:28,080
Did I say you could go?
让你走了吗？

1029
01:03:29,320 --> 01:03:31,640
Um... is Captain Ma in?
那个…马队在不在？

1030
01:03:31,720 --> 01:03:32,880
Go on over.
过去吧

1031
01:03:33,520 --> 01:03:34,840
Keep an eye on him for me.
你帮我看着点

1032
01:03:37,440 --> 01:03:38,800
Captain Ma.
马队

1033
01:03:38,880 --> 01:03:40,240
I thought you weren't in.
我以为你不在呢

1034
01:03:40,320 --> 01:03:42,000
Seeing you puts me at ease.
你在我就放心了

1035
01:03:44,480 --> 01:03:47,160
What's happened to my Yang'er, Captain Ma?
我们家阳儿怎么的了，马队？

1036
01:03:57,040 --> 01:03:58,240
Wang Yang is your son?
王阳是你儿子呀？

1037
01:03:58,960 --> 01:04:00,000
That's right.
对呀

1038
01:04:01,440 --> 01:04:04,120
He has a girlfriend named Shen Mo. You knew?
他有个女朋友叫沈墨 这事你知道吗？

1039
01:04:05,480 --> 01:04:06,520
Shen Mo?
沈墨？

1040
01:04:07,520 --> 01:04:09,200
I didn't know he had a girlfriend.
我不知道他有什么女朋友呀

1041
01:04:09,880 --> 01:04:11,000
You two go home and talk it over.
你们爷俩回去唠去吧

1042
01:04:11,080 --> 01:04:12,200
I'm done asking.
我问完了

1043
01:04:12,760 --> 01:04:15,280
Tell Wang Yang he's not to leave Hualin for now.
回去嘱咐王阳这段时间不许离开桦林

1044
01:04:15,840 --> 01:04:17,720
We may question him anytime.
我们随时有可能找他问话

1045
01:04:22,240 --> 01:04:23,080
Okay.
好

1046
01:04:25,760 --> 01:04:26,800
Captain Ma.
马队

1047
01:04:28,240 --> 01:04:30,320
-I did some canvassing...
-Master Wang.
-我进行了一下摸排…
-王师傅

1048
01:04:32,400 --> 01:04:33,920
Don't come to the bureau without cause.
没事少来公安局吧

1049
01:04:35,160 --> 01:04:37,760
And stop fretting over this case.
这案子你也别瞎操心了

1050
01:04:38,760 --> 01:04:40,000
Just drive your train.
好好开火车

1051
01:04:43,840 --> 01:04:45,720
Aren't I your Watson?
我不是华生吗？

1052
01:04:46,880 --> 01:04:48,360
Read fewer novels.
小说少看

1053
01:04:50,720 --> 01:04:51,880
I like Chandler.
我喜欢钱德勒

1054
01:04:52,560 --> 01:04:54,760
Guodong, see Master Wang out.
国栋，送一下王师傅

1055
01:04:55,680 --> 01:04:57,240
What... what-dler?
什么…什么德勒？

1056
01:04:57,320 --> 01:04:58,560
Master Wang.
王师傅

1057
01:04:58,640 --> 01:04:59,880
Get going.
赶紧走吧

1058
01:04:59,960 --> 01:05:00,960
Okay.
好

1059
01:05:03,360 --> 01:05:04,280
Captain Ma, I...
马队，我…

1060
01:05:05,480 --> 01:05:06,480
Okay.
好

1061
01:05:31,960 --> 01:05:33,440
You just had to stir up trouble.
折腾吧你就

1062
01:05:34,360 --> 01:05:35,880
A girlfriend pops up out of nowhere.
蹦出个女朋友来

1063
01:05:36,480 --> 01:05:38,200
What's with this girl?
这女的怎么回事呀？

1064
01:05:40,040 --> 01:05:42,080
I told the police everything I should.
该说的我都跟警察说了

1065
01:05:43,240 --> 01:05:44,840
She's dead, you know?
她死了，你知道不？

1066
01:05:46,520 --> 01:05:49,240
I told you not to work at that dump.
就不让你去那个烂糟地方上班

1067
01:05:49,320 --> 01:05:50,720
You boasted you just had to go.
炫耀说非得去

1068
01:05:52,240 --> 01:05:53,320
Just wait.
等着吧

1069
01:05:54,280 --> 01:05:55,840
When we're home, I'm locking you up.
回去就把你关起来

1070
01:05:56,920 --> 01:05:58,360
Once this is all cleared up,
把事查清楚了

1071
01:05:58,880 --> 01:06:00,160
then I'll let you downstairs.
再把你放下楼

1072
01:06:05,920 --> 01:06:07,280
Stop.
站住

1073
01:06:10,560 --> 01:06:12,680
Will running solve anything?
你跑能解决问题吗？

1074
01:06:13,360 --> 01:06:15,680
Just talk it out—isn't that enough?
有啥事说清楚不就完了吗？

1075
01:06:33,880 --> 01:06:34,880
Where's Yang'er?
阳儿呢？

1076
01:06:35,400 --> 01:06:36,400
Why isn't Yang'er back?
阳儿怎么没回来？

1077
01:06:36,480 --> 01:06:39,120
He'll be back soon, right behind me.
一会自己就回来了，前后脚的事

1078
01:06:39,640 --> 01:06:40,720
What did the police say?
警察怎么说的？

1079
01:06:40,800 --> 01:06:42,280
Nothing much. It's fine.
没怎么说，没事

1080
01:06:42,880 --> 01:06:44,720
If it's nothing, why'd they take him?
没事警察能找他吗？

1081
01:06:45,360 --> 01:06:47,840
You... wait up, I'm talking to you.
你…你等等我，跟你问你话呢

1082
01:06:51,880 --> 01:06:53,240
No—I called you
不是，我打电话给你

1083
01:06:53,320 --> 01:06:55,080
just to pick up our son, right?
不就让你接儿子吗？

1084
01:06:55,160 --> 01:06:57,120
So where is he then?
你给我接哪去了？

1085
01:06:57,200 --> 01:06:58,600
God, my heart's been pounding like crazy.
妈呀，我心都突突毁了

1086
01:06:58,680 --> 01:07:00,280
Is Yang'er really okay?
阳儿真没事呀？

1087
01:07:00,360 --> 01:07:01,680
Don't lie to me.
别糊弄我呀

1088
01:07:02,680 --> 01:07:04,800
He's my own son. Would I let him get hurt?
自己的儿子，我能让他有事吗？

1089
01:07:04,880 --> 01:07:06,280
Then when's he coming back?
那他啥时候回来呀？

1090
01:07:06,360 --> 01:07:07,400
Stop following me.
妳别跟着我

1091
01:07:07,480 --> 01:07:09,360
My head's buzzing. I'll lie down a bit.
脑瓜子嗡嗡的，我躺会

1092
01:07:11,280 --> 01:07:13,120
God, mine's buzzing too.
妈呀，我也嗡嗡的

1093
01:07:42,440 --> 01:07:45,400
(Forensics Lab)
（法医室）

1094
01:07:45,480 --> 01:07:46,520
That's enough.
行了

1095
01:07:50,560 --> 01:07:52,560
Captain Ma, this is Shen Mo's family.
马队，这是沈墨的家属

1096
01:07:52,640 --> 01:07:54,320
They came from Songhe for the identification.
从松河赶过来做辨认的

1097
01:07:54,400 --> 01:07:56,880
This is our sub-bureau's Criminal Police captain, Ma Desheng.
这是我们分局的刑警队长，马德胜

1098
01:07:56,960 --> 01:07:57,920
Hello.
你好

1099
01:07:58,920 --> 01:08:00,360
Captain Ma.
马队长

1100
01:08:00,440 --> 01:08:02,680
My hometown is Hualin too.
我老家也是咱们桦林的

1101
01:08:03,480 --> 01:08:06,680
I worked here in Hualin years ago.
早些年我在这个桦林工作过

1102
01:08:06,760 --> 01:08:09,840
I know some leaders in your police system quite well.
跟你们公安系统有些领导都比较熟

1103
01:08:11,000 --> 01:08:12,200
You done?
说完了吗？

1104
01:08:12,280 --> 01:08:14,040
Li Qun, take these two to the office first.
李群，先带二位去办公室

1105
01:08:14,720 --> 01:08:15,680
Let's go.
走吧

1106
01:08:16,320 --> 01:08:17,440
Anything else?
还有什么事吗？

1107
01:08:17,520 --> 01:08:19,760
Well, the case is still under investigation.
这不案子还在侦查阶段吗？

1108
01:08:19,840 --> 01:08:22,160
We need to ask about Shen Mo's recent situation.
得跟你了解一下沈墨的近况

1109
01:08:23,240 --> 01:08:24,400
Here's the thing.
是这样

1110
01:08:24,480 --> 01:08:26,160
I've already bought my return ticket.
我已经买了回程的车票

1111
01:08:26,240 --> 01:08:28,920
You know trains wait for no one.
你知道这火车可不等人呀

1112
01:08:29,000 --> 01:08:32,400
I have a lot waiting for me back in Songhe.
我回松河还有好多事等着我去处理呢

1113
01:08:32,480 --> 01:08:34,320
We can't exactly chat on the train, can we?
那也不能上火车上聊去吧？

1114
01:08:35,240 --> 01:08:36,280
We're all busy.
都挺忙

1115
01:08:38,200 --> 01:08:39,160
Fine.
好

1116
01:08:39,240 --> 01:08:41,320
Then we'll cooperate.
那我们配合配合

1117
01:08:42,880 --> 01:08:44,240
Stop crying.
别哭了

1118
01:08:47,040 --> 01:08:48,120
Let's go.
走吧

1119
01:09:00,560 --> 01:09:01,479
Captain Ma.
马队

1120
01:09:01,560 --> 01:09:03,399
Why does he seem so off to me?
我怎么瞅着他那么别扭呀？

1121
01:09:03,960 --> 01:09:04,920
Off how?
哪别扭啊？

1122
01:09:05,479 --> 01:09:07,439
To me, you two actually look quite alike.
我瞅着你俩长得倒挺相像的

1123
01:09:08,040 --> 01:09:09,240
What nonsense.
净瞎扯

1124
01:09:09,840 --> 01:09:12,319
I mean, he doesn't look like her real dad.
我是说瞅着不像亲爹呀

1125
01:09:12,399 --> 01:09:13,720
He's not her real dad.
本来就不是亲爹

1126
01:09:13,800 --> 01:09:14,920
He's her uncle.
她大爷

1127
01:09:15,479 --> 01:09:17,160
He adopted Shen Mo.
沈墨是他收养的

1128
01:09:17,880 --> 01:09:20,640
(The People's Police Serve the People)
（人民公安为人民）

1129
01:09:24,399 --> 01:09:25,560
Come here a sec.
你过来一下

1130
01:09:27,279 --> 01:09:28,560
Look.
你看

1131
01:09:28,640 --> 01:09:29,840
You've got sharp eyes.
你眼神好

1132
01:09:29,920 --> 01:09:32,200
Check the thermos on this nightstand for me.
你帮我看看这床头柜上边这个暖水瓶

1133
01:09:32,279 --> 01:09:33,800
There are two characters on it.
上边有俩字

1134
01:09:33,880 --> 01:09:35,359
What's this second character?
这后边这字是什么？

1135
01:09:36,520 --> 01:09:38,359
The paint's worn off the bottle.
这水瓶掉漆了

1136
01:09:38,439 --> 01:09:40,800
Duh—why else would I ask you?
废话，那干嘛让你看？

1137
01:09:43,720 --> 01:09:44,720
"Hui."
“会”

1138
01:09:44,800 --> 01:09:45,760
The character "hui."
“会”字

1139
01:09:46,319 --> 01:09:47,279
Let's see.
看看

1140
01:09:49,720 --> 01:09:51,840
Captain Ma, Chief Zhu called a meeting.
马队，朱局喊开会了

1141
01:09:54,080 --> 01:09:55,720
Calling a meeting now of all times.
在这时候喊开会

1142
01:09:57,720 --> 01:09:58,600
Here.
给

1143
01:09:58,680 --> 01:09:59,880
Save it for when I'm back.
留着一会回来吃吧

1144
01:09:59,960 --> 01:10:01,720
Let me get a sip—so thirsty.
我来口水，太渴了

1145
01:10:02,240 --> 01:10:03,439
There's no water here.
这没水呀还

1146
01:10:03,520 --> 01:10:04,560
Hurry...
赶紧…

1147
01:10:31,840 --> 01:10:32,840
Chief Zhu.
朱局

1148
01:10:32,920 --> 01:10:33,880
Sit.
坐下

1149
01:10:39,120 --> 01:10:40,240
Chief Zhu.
朱局

1150
01:10:41,880 --> 01:10:44,640
This so-called Hong Kong businessman is really from Zhanjiang, Guangdong.
这个所谓的港商其实是广东湛江人

1151
01:10:44,720 --> 01:10:46,080
He registered a company in Hong Kong.
在香港注册了公司

1152
01:10:46,560 --> 01:10:47,960
On the 5th, he spoke with his driver by phone.
5号他跟司机通了个电话

1153
01:10:48,880 --> 01:10:50,400
Then he became unreachable.
然后就联系不上了

1154
01:10:50,480 --> 01:10:53,120
Before vanishing, he received an 800,000-yuan money order from Hualin Steel.
他失踪之前 收了一张桦钢八十万的汇票

1155
01:10:53,200 --> 01:10:55,280
The bank says someone tried to cash it.
银行那边反映有人去提过这个钱

1156
01:10:55,360 --> 01:10:58,440
So we suspect this may not be a simple economic case.
所以我们怀疑这案子 可能不是简单的经济案件

1157
01:10:59,840 --> 01:11:02,080
Are you on top of this, Ma Desheng?
这情况你掌握不，马德胜？

1158
01:11:04,200 --> 01:11:06,280
What kind of captain are you?
你这队长是怎么当的？

1159
01:11:06,360 --> 01:11:07,840
None of us have been idle.
都没闲着

1160
01:11:07,920 --> 01:11:09,640
I want results.
我要的是结果

1161
01:11:10,200 --> 01:11:11,680
Drop the dismemberment case.
碎尸案的事你别管了

1162
01:11:11,760 --> 01:11:12,800
Hand it to the main squad.
交给总队吧

1163
01:11:12,880 --> 01:11:14,520
You all now go all-out
你们现在就全力以赴

1164
01:11:14,600 --> 01:11:16,560
on the cash-withdrawal lead.
抓住提现的这个线索

1165
01:11:17,080 --> 01:11:19,200
First find out who tried to cash that money.
先给我摸清楚是谁要提这个钱

1166
01:11:19,280 --> 01:11:20,840
Find...
摸…

1167
01:11:20,920 --> 01:11:22,000
Definitely on it.
肯定摸

1168
01:11:22,080 --> 01:11:23,240
I never said I wouldn't investigate.
没说不查呀

1169
01:11:23,320 --> 01:11:25,600
Give me two days—till I'm back from Songhe.
等我两天，等我从松河回来

1170
01:11:25,680 --> 01:11:27,240
Why Songhe?
去松河干啥？

1171
01:11:27,320 --> 01:11:30,360
I suspect the guy who took Shen Mo's nudes and wrote the anonymous letter
我怀疑给沈墨拍裸照 写匿名信的这家伙

1172
01:11:30,440 --> 01:11:32,160
had an unusual relationship with her.
跟沈墨的关系不一般

1173
01:11:32,240 --> 01:11:34,280
I'm heading to Songhe right away—alone.
我马上去趟松河，我自己去

1174
01:11:34,360 --> 01:11:35,960
I'll question her family thoroughly.
我再仔细问问他家属

1175
01:11:36,040 --> 01:11:38,320
Ma Desheng, do you not understand what I'm saying?
马德胜，我说话你是不是听不懂呀？

1176
01:11:38,400 --> 01:11:39,800
I can't work on anything else right now.
我现在干不了别的

1177
01:11:40,520 --> 01:11:42,320
Those body parts are just lying there.
那尸块就在那放着呢

1178
01:11:43,000 --> 01:11:44,040
We're this close to a lead.
眼看就有线索了

1179
01:11:44,120 --> 01:11:45,480
What if the guy really runs?
这人要真跑了怎么办？

1180
01:11:45,560 --> 01:11:47,720
Ma Desheng, you are a police officer.
马德胜，你是一个警察

1181
01:11:47,800 --> 01:11:50,640
You must do your duty on every case.
对每一个案子都要尽职尽责

1182
01:11:50,720 --> 01:11:52,000
I am a cop—
我是警察

1183
01:11:52,080 --> 01:11:53,480
and this is a homicide.
这人命案

1184
01:11:55,000 --> 01:11:55,960
Chief Zhu.
朱局

1185
01:11:56,600 --> 01:11:59,680
I have some thoughts on the missing businessman.
这个港商失踪的事我有点想法

1186
01:12:00,280 --> 01:12:04,040
How about I watch the withdrawal lead for Captain Ma for two days?
要不那个追查提现的事 我先替马队盯两天？

1187
01:12:04,120 --> 01:12:05,960
Stay out of it. This doesn't concern you.
你别吱声，这跟你没关系

1188
01:12:06,040 --> 01:12:07,240
How does it not?
怎么没关系呀？

1189
01:12:07,320 --> 01:12:08,840
He's a cop too.
他也是警察

1190
01:12:19,200 --> 01:12:26,120
(The People's Police Serve the People)
（人民公安为人民）

1191
01:12:31,280 --> 01:12:32,240
The bag.
包

1192
01:12:36,200 --> 01:12:38,120
Driving there alone this late?
这大晚上的，一个人开车去呀？

1193
01:12:38,200 --> 01:12:40,000
What? You want to come along?
怎么的？ 你要跟我一块去呀？

1194
01:12:40,080 --> 01:12:41,720
Get in. I'll drive you.
上车吧，我给你开

1195
01:12:41,800 --> 01:12:43,680
Better help Li Qun with the money order.
你还是帮李群弄那汇票的事吧

1196
01:12:43,760 --> 01:12:46,080
I'll be fine—back first thing tomorrow.
我啥事没有，明天一早就回来了

1197
01:12:46,880 --> 01:12:49,200
Don't keep bringing him up to me.
以后你别老跟我提他

1198
01:12:49,280 --> 01:12:50,760
You saw that just now, right?
刚才你都瞅见了吧？

1199
01:12:51,280 --> 01:12:52,560
Him, offering opinions.
他还提上意见了

1200
01:12:52,640 --> 01:12:53,600
Is it his place?
轮得着他吗？

1201
01:12:53,680 --> 01:12:55,040
The nerve of him.
不够他嚣张的

1202
01:12:55,120 --> 01:12:56,600
He did take some heat off me.
他也算帮我挡了火力了

1203
01:12:56,680 --> 01:12:58,200
All right, I'm off.
行了，走了啊

1204
01:13:00,880 --> 01:13:01,760
Got a smoke?
有烟吗？

1205
01:13:01,840 --> 01:13:03,520
What? Not quitting anymore?
怎么的？ 不戒了？

1206
01:13:06,600 --> 01:13:07,840
Forget it.
算了

